<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">JDG-TSISHINGINI (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">A̱za̱ o uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="toc3">A̱.Ug</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="toc1">A̱za̱ o Uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="mt1">A̱za̱ o Uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa Aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada a nda alabari a ɗa wa azagbain, a wawi a̱za̱ o uge'etosu wu gundo va aza a Isra'ila, waru u to rocosu a na A̱sula̱ a̱yi a̱ nde'en a̱yi ɗa Zagbain Wawi va amayun. A Tsunasara na̱ Tsugana awawi'i e ɗe le ta̱ &lt;&lt;a̱za̱ o uge'etosu,&gt;&gt; amma ele azagbain a ɗa a̱ shi la̱nga̱ a nna A̱sulazuva a ɗangulai adama a kamba a wawa gundo va aza a Isra'ila. Ulinga wa azagbai'in a̱yi ɗa o rono ama aɗanga a mantsa mo uvon, a mantsa mo ro waru gba a̱ tsu ge'eto ta̱ mawasan ma na ma̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a ama. Mantsa na̱ a̱bunda̱ aza a Isra'ila a̱ kuru wila̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ shi, reve gba A̱sulazuva a̱ lyunguwa̱ le na̱ n'yuwatan a ca le a̱tsuma̱lima̱. Reve na aza a Isra'ila e ɗe A̱sulazuva u kamba le. A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu lyungu ta̱ za vi iwawi na aa kamba le a lyuwa aci a n'yuwatan n le. Agba na̱ wawi'i u kuwa̱, reve ama'a a vadalisa a lyawa A̱sulazuva. A̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada a nda alabari a nda a ka̱mbusa̱ ta̱ kuci. Aatagada a nda a fara ta̱ a mantsa ma na Isra'ila usai iɗa ya ka'ana amma na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ cina Josuwa kuwa̱. Aatagada a nda a ca ta̱ alabari vu unusu mantsa kafu mogono mo ufaru ma aza a Isra'ila. Ili i gbain i na u lobonoi e reve a̱yi ɗa a wawi'i a a yuwan tsugbain tsimiɗa'a suru tso mogono shi. Amma o rono ta̱ ama aɗanga a̱ mgbain n ro la̱nga̱. Waru a mantsa mo ro wawi ko zagbain ko za vu uge'etosu'u u rono ta̱ ama a̱ yi aɗanga a mantsa ma̱ ta̱ ma na wawi ro ronoi ama aɗanga a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ n ro ko'o. Mantsa ma Japuta na̱ Samuso a̱yi ɗa iroci yi ili i na aa dansa. Adanshi a gbain a aatagada'a a̱yi nden n tsipere ni iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a ama a̱ A̱sula̱ no oforo adama o unusu u le u tsu zuwa le le ta̱ a zami tsugbain tsa na A̱sulazuva goon zuwai. Idanshi i gbain ele ɗa, &lt;&lt;A mantsa mo ndolo, aza a Isra'ila a̱ shi na̱ mogono ne'e shi, adama o ndolo vuma suru yuwusan ta̱ ili i na we enei mejege ma ɗa a majiyan ma̱ yi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="is">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">A̱ kuɗa̱i a lyuwa iɗa ya Ka'ana nu uvon na awawi a na A̱sula̱ a ɗangulai 1:1-3:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Alabari a̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu na azagbain ko awawi a Isra'ila 3:7-16:32</para>
  <para style="io2">Otiniye 3:7-11</para>
  <para style="io2">Ehud 3:12-30</para>
  <para style="io2">Shamga 3:31</para>
  <para style="io2">Debora na̱ Barak 4:1-5:31</para>
  <para style="io2">Gidiyon nu ulobo wa̱ yi Abimele 6:1-9:57</para>
  <para style="io2">Tola na̱ Jayi 10:1-5</para>
  <para style="io2">Jeputa 10:6-12:7</para>
  <para style="io2">Ibuzan na̱ Elon na̱ Abadon 12:8-15</para>
  <para style="io2">Samuso 13:1 16:31</para>
  <para style="io1">Alabari adama a tsushakala tsu ugundo wa Dan 17:1-18:31</para>
  <para style="io1">Alabari adama o unusu wu ugundo wa Banyami 19:1-21:25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Ugundo wa Yahuza na̱ Saminu a lyuwa ta̱ Adoni Beze nu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Ana Josuwa kuwa̱i, aza a Isra'ila e ece ta̱ A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;Ugundo u ne u ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu waa fara 'ya̱wa̱a̱ tsu u yuwan uvon na aza a Ka'ana?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Ugundo wa Yahuza u ɗa wa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱. Uwwai nda, n ca ta̱ ɗe iɗa'a e ekere e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Reve ama a Yahuza a damma a̱za̱ e le a̱za̱ o ugundo wa Saminu, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i tsu 'ya̱wa̱i oɓolo a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa akunda e iɗa i na a ca ntsu, tsa̱ra̱ tsu yuwain uvon na aza a Ka'ana. Ne ɗa a̱tsu fo tsa̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu upasu wa akunda e iɗa i na a ca nɗu.&gt;&gt; Reve ugundo wa Saminu u 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo ne ele.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Ana ugundo wa Yahuza u farai uvon, ɗaɗa gba A̱sulazuva a cayi aza a Ka'ana na aza a Periziya e ekere e le, a̱vu o una ama ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) ɗe Beze. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Ele ɗe reve a cina ɗe Adoni Beze, a̱vu a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱yi, a̱vu waru a lyuwa aza a Ka'ana na aza a Periziya nu uvon. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />A̱vu Adoni Beze suma, a̱vu a saɓa yi e reme yi reve o koɗo akatsu a gbagbain e ekere a̱ yi na aza a ana a̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />A̱vu Adoni Beze damma, &lt;&lt;Ngono kupocindere n na o koɗoi akatsu a gbagbain e ekere e le na aza a ana e le, a yuwusan ta̱ wuta̱ɗu wi ilyalya za̱la̱ va apada a̱ va̱. Cine n yuwain, ne ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a tsupaa numu.&gt;&gt; Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, ɗe ɗa u kuwa̱i.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ugundo wa Yahuza u lyuwa ta̱ Urishelima na̱ Heburon nu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Reve ugundo wa Yahuza u yuwan uvon na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima, a̱vu a lyuwa yi nu uvon. A̱vu o kototo ama a̱ yi na̱ matsun me pe'eni, a̱vu waru a daɓa lyuci'i na akina.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi, a̱vu aza a Yahuza a̱ zura̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a yuwan uvon na aza a Ka'ana aza a na a̱ ri nden e iɗa ya agaɗi, na̱ a̱tsuma̱ o upasu we Nege ne e iɗa i mugaɗi. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Reve e reme uvon na aza a Ka'ana a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a Heburon, za na a̱ shi a̱ tsu ɗe Kiriyat Arba nu ufaru. A̱vu a lyuwa ugundo wa Sheshai, oɓolo na̱ Ahiman na̱ Talmai nu uvon.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otiniye lyuwa ta̱ lyuci va Debi nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 15:15-19">Jos 15:15-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Diga ɗe Heburon reve ama a Yahuza a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i a yuwan uvon na aza a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a Debi, za na a̱ shi a̱ tsu ɗe Kiriyat Sefa nu ufaru. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />A̱vu Keleb damma, &lt;&lt;N ta ca vuma na suru riya̱yi Kiriyat Sefa nu uvon a̱vu u lyuwa yi, lolo vu usheli u va̱ Akisa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />A̱vu Otiniye ulobo wu zawa'a va Keleb za na a̱ tsu ɗe Kena u lyuwa lyuci'i nu uvon, ɗaɗa Keleb ca niyi usheli wa̱ yi Akisa u zuwai.<verse eid="JDG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Urana u ro ana Akisa ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Otiniye, a̱vu Otiniye kushanu yi u pati dada va̱ yi atsusa. Ana u cipa̱i o mololi ma̱ yi, a̱vu Keleb ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye vu cigai n yuwaan wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Vu yuwaan mu ta̱ isa'ani, ana vu ca numu iɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Nege. N ciga ta̱ waru vu ca mu esu a̱ mini.&gt;&gt; Reve Keleb ca yi esu a̱ mini za na ri gon na̱ za va̱ za̱la̱.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱bunda̱ a̱ ba̱ta̱ na ugundo wa Yahuza na̱ Banyami a lyuwai nu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Reve umatsun wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Keni, wa̱ a̱sha̱wa̱ a̱ le a Musa oɓolo na ama a Yahuza a gawan diga a̱ Lyuci Gbain vu Shuwa za na a̱yi ɗa Jeriko adama a̱ da̱nu oɓolo na ama a̱ A̱tsumona a Yahuda, za na ri upasu we Nege zuzu na̱ Arada.<verse eid="JDG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />A̱vu ugundo wa Yahuza a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na aza a Saminu a̱za̱ e le, a̱vu a lyuwa aza a Ka'ana nu uvon aza a na a̱ shi nden a̱tsuma̱ a Zefa, a̱vu o kototo lyuci'i suru suru. Adama o ndolo a ɗa a cayi lyuci'i ala Homa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Homa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda urevu wa &lt;&lt;Homa&gt;&gt; a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;ukototosu suru suru.&gt;&gt; </char></note> <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />A̱vu waru ama a Yahuza a lyuwa Gaza na̱ Ashikelon na̱ Ekuron nu uvon, suru nle na̱ pasu na ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele.<verse eid="JDG 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na ama a Yahuza. A̱vu a usa iɗa ya agaɗi, agba a gura gba̱ra̱ aza a na a̱ ri agalaci shi adama a na a̱ shi ta̱ ni ikeke yi ido yi irumu. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />A ca ta̱ Keleb Heburon cine Musa yuwain nzuwulai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Jos 15:13-14</char></note> A̱vu a̱yi gba u gba̱ra̱ umatsun wo olobo a ta'atsu wa Anaku pe. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Amma ugundo wa Banyami u gba̱ra̱ aza a Jebusiya aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima shi. Ɗaɗa aza a Jebusiya a̱ ri nden pe oɓolo nu ugundo wa Banyami hali na ana'an.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gundo va̱ Isuhu lyuwa ta̱ Betel nu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Gundo va̱ Isuhu yuwan ta̱ uvon na̱ lyuci va Betel waru A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo ne ele. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />A mantsa ma na a̱ lyunguyi ama a tawa utyo we Betel, za na a̱ shi a̱ tsu ɗe Luz nu ufaru, <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />a̱vu aza a matawa mo utyo wi iɗa'a e ene vuma o uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i, reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri roco tsu ure a uwa pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i, a̱tsu gba tsu to roco wu isa'ani ya amayun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Reve u roco le ure a uwa pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i. Reve o una ama a̱ lyuci'i na̱ matsun me pe'eni, a̱vu gba a lyawa vuma'a na ama o u'wa wa̱ yi suru a la'a. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />A̱vu vuma'a u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo e iɗa ya aza a Hitiya, a̱vu u suwa lyuci a̱vu u ca yi aala Luz, a̱yi ɗa gba aala a̱ yi hali na ana'an.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ama a na aza a Isra'ila a̱ gba̱ra̱i e iɗa'a shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Ugundo wa Manase u gba̱ra̱ aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Bet Shan na̱ Ta'ana na̱ Do na̱ Ibileyam na̱ Megido, oɓolo na̱ mulyuci n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele shi, adama a na aza a Ka'ana a zuwa ta̱ okolo a̱ da̱nu pe a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Ana aza a Isra'ila a yuwain ucira lon, reve a zuwa aza a Ka'ana ulinga u tsugbashi nu ucira, agba a̱ gba̱ra̱ le suru suru shi.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Waru ugundo wa Ifiramu a̱ gba̱ra̱ aza a Ka'ana aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Geza shi. Amma aza a Ka'ana a lyuwa ta̱ elime na̱ nden oɓolo ne ele pe.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Waru ugundo wa̱ Zebulun u gba̱ra̱ aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Kitron na̱ Nahala shi. Ɗaɗa aza a Ka'ana a lyuwai elime na̱ nden oɓolo ne ele. Reve gba ama a Zebulun a zuwa le ulinga u tsugbashi nu ucira.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Ugundo wa Asha waru u gba̱ra̱ aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Ako na̱ Sidon na Ahala na Akizi na̱ Helba na̱ Afe na̱ Reho shi. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Adama o ndolo ugundo wa Asha u da̱nu ta̱ oɓolo na aza a Ka'ana a̱za̱ e iɗa'a, adama a na a̱ gba̱ra̱ le shi.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Ugundo wa Nafutali waru u gba̱ra̱ aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Bet Shemesh na̱ Bet Ana shi. A̱vu gba ele fo a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Ka'ana, a̱za̱ e iɗa'a. Na̱ ne suru, ugundo wa Nafutali u zuwa ta̱ aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Bet Shemesh na̱ Bet Ana ulinga u tsugbashi nu ucira.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Aza a Amoriya a̱ ca̱co ta̱ ugundo wa Dan a̱ ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya agaɗi nu ucira, a lyawa le a̱ da̱nu agalaci shi. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Aza a Amoriya a zuwa ta̱ okolo a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a Masasan ma̱ Here na̱ Ajalon na̱ Sha'albim. Agba ana gundo va̱ Isuhu da̱shiyi ucira, a̱vu a zuwa le fo ulinga u tsugbashi nu ucira.<verse eid="JDG 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Utyo wa aza a Amoriya u toni ta̱ diga Sela a gawan nu ure wa Akarabim a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ elime.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva a Bokim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ ka̱ra̱ a gawan diga Gilga a̱ tyo Bokim a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Mu uta̱a̱ ɗu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, a̱vu n ta̱wa̱to ɗu e iɗa i na n kucinayi nkaya n ɗu akucunu n ta ca le. N damma ta̱, &lt;Maa kuɗa akucunu a̱ va̱ na̱ a̱ɗu shi ko ke'en. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />She i yuwan akucunu na ama e iɗa i nda wan, agba yi ɓoso musa'a n le.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mta̱ 34:12-13; U.Wl 7:2-5; U.Wl 12:1-3</char></note> Agba i 'yuwan ta̱ a yuwan tsutoni na̱ a̱mu. Nye i zuwai i yuwain cu'un nda? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Adama o ndolo gogo n ta dansa ɗu, ma̱a̱ gba̱ra̱ ama a nda a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu shi. O to o'wo ɗu awanda a̱ lipu ɗu, musula̱ n le waru o to o'wo ɗu maza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Ana malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma dammai aza a Isra'ila suru ili i nda, ama a shon ta̱ na̱ yisali lon. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa e ɗe yi uba̱ta̱'a̱ Bokim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bokim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda urevu wa̱ &lt;&lt;Bokim&gt;&gt; a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;a̱za̱ a̱ mesun.&gt;&gt;</char></note> Reve a yuwaan A̱sulazuva kucci lo uba̱ta̱'a̱.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa̱ Josuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Ana Josuwa lyawai aza a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱ra̱i, a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱ usa agadu e iɗa'a, ugundo suru adama u usa agadu a̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Aza a Isra'ila yuwaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱ a rana wuma wa̱ Josuwa suru, na̱ suru a mantsa ma mbara n na n shi wuma cina Josuwa kuwa̱, aza a na waru e enei ili i gbagbain i na A̱sulazuva a yuwayin aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="JDG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun, aagbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱yi na a'wan ukpaku na̱ kupa (110). <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />A̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya agadu a̱ yi, a̱tsuma̱ a Timnat Here<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Timnat Here </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aala o ro a &lt;&lt;Timnat Here&gt;&gt; a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;Timnat Sera.&gt;&gt; Ka̱lyuwa̱: Jos 19:50; 24:30</char></note> e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu, ugana u Masasan ma Ga'ash.<verse eid="JDG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Ana ama a mantsa mo ndolo suru a̱ kuwa̱i a̱vu a cina nkaya n le, reve muwun n le n kungwa, agba e reve A̱sulazuva ko e reve ili i na u yuwayin aza a Isra'ila shi.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulambu u tsutoni wa aza a Isra'ila na̱ ma̱riya̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Reve aza a Isra'ila e reme a yuwusan ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a yuwusaan a̱ma̱li a Ba'al a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Reve a lyawa a̱ kurusu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya n le, za na uta̱a̱ nle a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Masar. Reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ kurusu a̱ma̱li a ama a na a̱ ri lo uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele reve e reme a yuwusaan le a̱ga̱nda̱. Reve a zuwa A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Reve a lyawa a̱ kurusu A̱sulazuva reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a yuwusaan Ba'al oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱li a Ashitore a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan na aza a Isra'ila lon, ɗaɗa gba u zuwa nle e ekere a aza a na a̱a̱ pura̱ ili i na a̱ ri ne ele suru, reve gba a̱ pura̱ itana i le suru. Reve u zuwa le e ekere a n'yuwatan n le aza a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele, a gura geshe aciyele e ekere e le waru shi. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila o uta̱ uvon suru, ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva u tsu da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱ nla̱ngi ne ele, cine u kucinaa nle. A̱ shi ta̱ a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Ɗaɗa u 'ya̱sa̱in a̱za̱ o uge'etosu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft">A̱za̱ o uge'etosu a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada a̱ A̱za̱ o Uge'etosu a̱ ri tsa̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu o gogo a̱tsuma̱ o ukobu wu uge'etosu shi.</char></note> aza a na a wawa nle e ekere a aza a na a̱ tsu pura̱ itana i le. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Na̱ ne suru a zuwaa a̱za̱ o uge'etosu u le atsuvu shi, reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a yuwusan tsushakala o ure u na a yuwusaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱. A jima pe o ure u na nkaya n le n walasai shi, a vadalashi ta̱ a lyawa ure u tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva u na nkaya n le n kurusuyi. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Na̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n aza a Isra'ila za vu uge'etosu suru, u tsu da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, reve u wawa ama'a e ekere a n'yuwatan n le a mantsa ma na za vu uge'etosu ndolo ri wuma. Adama a na A̱sulazuva e tse ene ta̱ iliyali ya ama a̱ yi, aza a na a̱ ri a̱ ma̱nga̱ e ekere a aza a na oo ɓongishi le na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Amma na̱ za vu uge'etosu'u u kuwa̱, reve ama'a a vadala a̱ ka̱mba̱ e re vi idaba na la'ai za vu nkaya n le. O tsu toni ta̱ musula̱ n ro a yuwusaan le tsugbashi na̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. A lyawa linga vi iwuya le na aciyogbamu e le shi.<verse eid="JDG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Adama o ndolo reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan na aza a Isra'ila lon, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Adama a na ama a nda a kuɗai akucunu a na n yuwain na̱ nkaya n le waru a zuwaa numu atsuvu shi, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />m buwa a̱ da̱shi losoo le nɗa n na m buwai n na Josuwa lyawai ana u kuwa̱i shi. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />N ta yuwan ulinga ne ele n lyungwa̱ aza a Isra'ila me ene ko a̱ ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu o toni ure u va̱, reve waru a yuwan mmalu cine nkaya n le n yuwain.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a lyawai nɗa n ndolo, u loso le nu uta̱ shi. Agba waru u ca le e ekere a̱ Josuwa shi.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Nɗa n na m buwai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Apa nda nɗa n na A̱sulazuva a lyawai, adama a̱ lyungwa̱ aza a Isra'ila suru aza a na e peɗei uvon a̱tsuma̱ a Ka'ana shi. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />U yuwan ta̱ ne adama u roco limatan ve elime va aza a Isra'ila uvon, ele aza a na koto a̱ shi a yuwain uvon shi. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Apa nɗa'a: azagbain o ton a aza a Filistiya na aza a Ka'ana suru na aza a Sidon na aza a Hiviya a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a nsasan ma Lebanon, diga a Masasan ma Ba'al Hamon a̱ tyo Lebo Hamat. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />A lyawa le ta̱ a̱ lyungwa̱ aza a Isra'ila ko a ta yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, za na u cayi nkaya n le e ekere a Musa.<verse eid="JDG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱nu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Ka'ana na aza a Hitiya na aza Amoriya na aza a Periziya na aza a Hiviya oɓolo na aza a Jebusiya. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Reve a tara esheli a aza a Ka'ana o o'wo a̱ma̱ci e le, reve ele fo a tara esheli e le a ca olobo a aza a Ka'ana lolo. Ɗaɗa gba a yuwayin musula̱ n le a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otiniye wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Aza a Isra'ila gba a yuwan ta̱ ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. E icina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a yuwusaan a̱ma̱li a Ba'al na̱ Ashera a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan na aza a Isra'ila lon, reve u zuwa le e ekere a Kushan Rishatayim mogono ma Mesopotamiya. Reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwaan yi tsugbashi hali a'wan kunla̱. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Amma a mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila e showeyin A̱sulazuva, u 'ya̱sa̱a̱n le ta̱ na̱ za na wawa nle, a̱yi ɗa Otiniye ulobo wu zawa'a va Keleb za na a̱ tsu ɗe Kena. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva cipa̱a̱ yi ta̱, reve gba wo o'wo za vu uge'etosu va aza a Isra'ila. U 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ uvon, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a ca yi Kushan Rishatayim mogono ma Mesopotamiya e ekere a̱ yi. A̱vu u lyuwa ucira wa Kushan Rishatayim. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Ɗaɗa iɗa'a yi ivuwain nu uvon hali a'wan amunga, hali she na Otiniye ulobo wa̱ Kena u kuwa̱i.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehud wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Reve waru aza a Isra'ila a yuwisan ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu A̱sulazuva a zuwa Egilon mogono ma̱ Mowa ma la'a le ucira, adama a na a yuwain ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Reve u ɓoloto aza a Amon na aza a Amaleka, a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a lyuwa aza a Isra'ila nu uvon. Reve a usa Lyuci Gbain vu Shuwa za na a̱yi ɗa Jeriko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a yuwaan Egilon mogono ma̱ Mowa tsugbashi hali a'wan kupa na̱ kunla̱.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />A̱vu waru aza a Isra'ila e showen A̱sulazuva, reve u 'ya̱sa̱a̱n le za vi iwawi Ehud ma̱gula̱, ulobo wa Gera o ugundo wa Banyami. A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ lyunguwa̱ Egilon mogono ma̱ Mowa nu uneꞌe e ekere a Ehud. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />A̱vu Ehud yuwaan aciya̱yi matsun me pe'eni ma̱ na̱ re, uga'an wa̱ yi u rawa ta̱ udasuwu anana a̱ ta̱ na akapi. A̱vu wu nla̱ matsu'un a aagutsu o usa'ani wa̱ yi, a̱vu wu pala yi nu utugu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />A̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱a̱ nu uneꞌe'e uba̱ta̱ wa Egilon mogono ma̱ Mowa. Egilon gba vuma na ri na̱ lipu lon ɗa. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ana Ehud ca niyi uneꞌe'e, a̱vu u zuwa ama a na a kamba niyi itana yu une'e'e a̱ ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />A̱vu Ehud na aciya̱yi u ka̱ra̱ oɓolo ne ele hali she ana a rawai uba̱ta̱ wa̱ atali o ushe'un zuzu na̱ Gilga, a̱vu u ka̱mba̱. Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Mogono, n ta̱ ni ikaka yu usokowu adama a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">A̱vu mogono ma damma azagbain a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Buwaa ntsu ure!&gt;&gt; A̱vu azagbain a̱ yi suru o uta̱.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />A̱vu Ehud rawa ya̱'a̱ yi a̱yi nden a̱ nde'en a aasula ɗe o u'wa wa zuva uba̱ta̱ u na u ri uta̱nu. A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;N tsura̱ ta̱ ikaka uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ adama a̱ wu.&gt;&gt; A̱vu mogono ma̱ 'yon uba̱ta̱ u na u da̱na̱i nden. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />A̱vu Ehud zuwa ukere wu ugula̱ wa̱ yi, u tala matsun me pe'eni a aagutsu o usa'ani wa̱ yi, reve u sapaa mogono'o a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Matsun me pe'eni'i ma uwa ta̱ oɓolo nu ukutsu suru, a̱vu mani'in ma pala yi. Ehud rono matsun me pe'eni'i o uta̱ shi. Reve tsishin tso mogono tso lolo. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />A̱vu Ehud uta̱, a̱vu u ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu va aasula a zuva reve u katsu le.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ana u ka̱ra̱i, reve azagbain o mogono'o a̱ ta̱wa̱. Ana a cinai na̱ntsu'u ukatsuwu, a jiyan ta̱, &lt;&lt;U ta yuwan u uwa rulu a aasula o uta̱nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />O puro ta̱ hali a̱ kuna̱. Amma ana u kpa̱tu'wa̱i na̱ntsu va aasula'a shi, reve a tara kpa̱tu'utsu a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ le. A̱vu a cina zagbain le nven e iɗa ukwa̱!<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />A mantsa ma na a̱ shi e ipiri, reve Ehud puwa̱n. Reve u ka̱ra̱la̱i nu uba̱ta̱ wa atali o ushe'un, a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Seyira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Ana u rawai, reve wi ivula̱ aavana ɗe e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu. A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ zura̱ a̱ cipa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a lyawa iɗa ya agaɗi'i, a̱yi ɗa u rono nle aɗanga.<verse eid="JDG 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;Toni numu, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ca ɗu ta̱ ɗe n'yuwatan n ɗu a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa e ekere a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt; Reve a̱ kuru yi a̱cipa̱ a̱vu a usa upasata wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa. A lyawa nanza pasa shi. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />A mantsa'a o una ta̱ ali o uvon o ucira wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa ukpakukupa kupa (10,000). Babu vuma na la'ai. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />O urana u ndolo u ɗa aza a Isra'ila a lyuwai aci a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa. Reve iɗa'a yi ivuwan nu uvon a'wan kupakunla̱.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamga wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ Ehud she Shamga ulobo wa Ana, za na unai aza a Filistiya ukpakuta̱li (600) na aaɗanga a̱ ma̱gba̱ra̱ me inan. A̱yi fo u wawa ta̱ Isra'ila.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debora na̱ Barak a wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ana Ehud kuwa̱i waru, reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwisan ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Reve A̱sulazuva zuwa le e ekere a Jabin mogono ma Ka'ana, za na shi o tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a Hazo. Sisera ɗa da̱na̱i yali ya̱ a̱soja ya̱ yi, za na da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ a Haroshet vu Nɗa. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Reve ama a Isra'ila e showen A̱sulazuva, adama a na Jabin da̱na̱ ta̱ ni ikeke yi ido yi irumu ukpaku kucci (900) reve u ɓongi nu ule'eshiyi aza a Isra'ila hali a'wan ushin.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Debora ka va Lapido, vumava̱sula̱ a̱yi ɗa u shi za vu uge'etosu va aza a Isra'ila a mantsa mo ndolo. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />U tsu da̱nusu ta̱ e ikyun yu Ushuwa wa̱ Debora e memere ma Rama na̱ Betel e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu, reve aza a Isra'ila a gawan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi ɗe adama o uge'etosu. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Reve u zuwa e ɗe Barak ulobo wa Abinowam diga a̱ lyuci va Kedesh a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Nafutali, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a damma wu ta̱, &lt;'Ya̱wa̱, vu tara ali ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) o ugundo wa Nafutali na̱ Zebulun, vu rono le aɗanga a̱ tyo a Masasan ma Tabo. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />A̱mu n to rono Sisera yali ya̱ a̱soja a Jabin ugbozu, oɓolo ni ikeke yi ido ya̱ yi na̱ a̱za̱ o uvon a̱ yi, a̱ tyo o Uɗolu wa̱ Kishon. N ta̱ gba aa ca wu a̱yi e ekere a̱ wu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Reve Barak damma yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ va̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, n ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱, agba na̱ va̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu shi, ma̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Reve Debora damma, &lt;&lt;U yuwan ta̱, n ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu. Agba tsugbain tsu mmalu tsa nda tsoo o'wo za va̱ wu shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa Sisera e ekere a ka.&gt;&gt; Reve Debora 'yon a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ Barak a̱ tyo Kedesh. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />A̱vu Barak ɗe ugundo wa̱ Zebulun na̱ za va Nafutali a̱ tyo Kedesh. Reve ama ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) o toni yi, reve fo Debora 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Heba gba za va Keni wu kasa ta̱ ɗe na aza a Keni, umatsun wa̱ Hoba a̱sha̱wa̱le Musa, reve u shuwa̱ oogodo a̱ yi zuzu nu uɗanga wo Oku a̱tsuma̱ a Za'ananim za na ri zuzu na̱ Kedesh.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Ana a dammai Sisera a na Barak ulobo wa Abinowam u ka̱ra̱ ta̱ a gawan a Masasan ma Tabo, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />a̱vu u ɓoloto ikeke yi ido yi irumu ya̱ yi suru ukpaku kucci (900) na ali o uvon a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi suru, diga Haroshet vu Nɗa a̱ tyo o Uɗolu wa̱ Kishon.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />A̱vu Debora damma Barak, &lt;&lt;'Yon! Apa urana u na A̱sulazuva a cayi Sisera e ekere a̱ wu. Na amayun A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ elime a̱ wu.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Barak cipa̱i a Masasan ma Tabo, reve ama ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) o toni. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Ana Barak remei uvon na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi, reve A̱sulazuva a zuwa Sisera ra̱pula̱ ni ikeke yi ido ya̱ yi na ali o uvon a̱ yi suru. Reve Sisera cipa̱ e ikeke vi ido ya̱ yi reve u suma. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />A̱vu Barak saɓa ikeke yi ido oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ yi hali a̱ tyo Haroshet vu Nɗa. A̱vu o una ali o uvon a Sisera suru. Ko vuma ta̱ la'a shi.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Amma Sisera suma ta̱ a̱ tyo o oogodo a Jaye, ka va Heba za va Keni, adama a na Jabin mogono ma Hazo na̱ limatan va Heba za va Keni a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a muwwulai.<verse eid="JDG 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />A̱vu Jaye uta̱ u raba Sisera a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Uwa, zagbain va̱, uwa o oogodo a̱ va̱. She vu uwwa wovon wan.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa u uwai o oogodo a̱ yi, a̱vu wu pala yi nu umuna.<verse eid="JDG 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Reve Sisera damma yi, &lt;&lt;N ta uwwusa akuli, yuwan ankuri ne'e mu mini ke'en n sowo.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Jaye kpa̱tu'wa̱ tsa̱n vu ukwan maani, a̱vu u ca yi u sowo, a̱vu wu palisa yi waru.<verse eid="JDG 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Reve Sisera damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vi isawan o una̱ntsu wo oogodo'o, na̱ vuma ro ta̱wa̱ we ece wu, &lt;Za ta̱ pa?&gt; Vu usu yi, &lt;O'o.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Amma Jaye ka va Heba tara ta̱ rumu ma̱shuwa̱ mo oogodo, a̱vu u tara ma̱ka̱ta̱. Reve u 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ yi ben a̱yi nven a nlavu cina u kuna̱ ɗe a̱bunda̱ lon. Reve u vara na̱ rumu ma̱shuwa̱ mo oogodo'o e kengi vu utsuvu va̱ yi hali wu urulai a̱ tyo e iɗa, ɗaɗa gba u kuwa̱i.<verse eid="JDG 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Barak gba o tono Sisera, a̱vu Jaye uta̱ u raba yi. A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱, n to roco wu vuma na vu ri e izami.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Barak uwa o oogodo a̱ yi, she nlo gba Sisera nven uvaru na̱ ili i ma̱shuwa̱ mo oogodo e kengi vu utsuvu va̱ yi ukwa̱!<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />O urana u ndolo u ɗa A̱sula̱ a cayi aza a Isra'ila ulyuwu wa aci a Jabin mogono ma Ka'ana nu uvon. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱shishi ucira, reve o ɓongishi Jabin mogono ma Ka'ana, hali she ana o kototo niyi.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Ishipa ya̱ Debora na̱ Barak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />O urana u ndolo a̱vu Debora na̱ Barak ulobo wa Abinowam a cana ishipa i nda a damma,<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />&lt;&lt;Ana azagbain a aza a Isra'ila a tarai tsugbain tsa Isra'ila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">ana ama a cayi aciyele nu ucigu u le a yuwan uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">a cuwa A̱sulazuva!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />&lt;&lt;Poloi atsuvu a̱ɗu ngono!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Uwwai nda, a̱ɗu aza a tsugbain!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">A̱mu na aciya̱va̱ n ta canaa A̱sulazuva ishipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">n ta canaa A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila ishipa yi ica.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva, mantsa ma na vu lyawai nsasan ma̱ Seyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">ana vu uta̱i e iɗa ya Edom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">iɗa i jinga̱ɗa̱ ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">a̱vu iro'i yu ucira yo oco diga zuva.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">Ee, eleshe o oco ta̱ mini mo ucira.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Nsasan n jinga̱ɗa̱ ta̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">ko Masasan ma Sinai<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">Mta̱ 19:18</ref>.</char></note> fo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />&lt;&lt;A rana va Shamga, ulobo wa Ana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">a rana va Jaye, a lyawa ta̱ itoni yu uregbain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">reve aza a mmalu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ kurusu a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ta̱ e re.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Reve mulyuci ma aza a Isra'ila mo o'wo okongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">mo o'wo okongo she mantsa ma na a̱mu Debora n 'yoyin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">N 'yoyin tsa mma e ekere a aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Ana a ɗangwai musula̱ n sa'avu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">a̱vu uvon u ta̱wa̱ a̱ na̱ntsu lyuci gbain.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">Amma ko a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ ko ibata a̱ tsura̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ o uvon ukpakukupa amunga (40,000) a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila shi.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Okolo a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u nan yali o uvon a Isra'ila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">aza a na a cayi aciyele nu ucigu u le a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">A cuwa A̱sulazuva!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />&lt;&lt;I yuwan adanshi e ili i na A̱sulazuva a yuwain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">a̱ɗu na i kumbai nloli n uri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">a̱ɗu na i ri nden a̱ rutsu sa'ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">na̱ a̱ɗu fo na a zuwai mmalu a ana o ure uba̱ta̱ u na ya̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ biti.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />I polo atsuvu o uɗyo wa aza a na aa tanusu mini o una̱ wo oko'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">a casu alabari o ulyuwu wa aci a̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">ulyuwu wa aci wa aza a Isra'ila.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">&lt;&lt;A̱vu ama a̱ A̱sulazuva a dasu a̱ cipa̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">a̱ tyo o una̱ntsu.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />A damma, &lt;Vu 'yon, vu 'yon, a̱vu Debora!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">'Yon, 'yon vu uwa elime, vu cana ishipa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Vu 'yon a̱vu Barak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">vu guɓa aza a na vu pura̱i, a̱vu ulobo wa Abinowam.&gt;<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu ama a na a pasai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">a̱ cipa̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa azagbain e le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:13">ama a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">oɓolo na̱ n'yuwatan mu ucira ma̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Ozo o ro o uta̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Ifiramu, aza a na ikyun i le i ri a̱tsuma̱ a Amaleka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ikyun i le i ri a̱tsuma̱ a Amaleka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iɗana yu ufaru i ro i zuwa ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱ zura̱i a̱ cipa̱ o uka̱ri.&gt;&gt;</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">Banyami shi ta̱ oɓolo na aza a na a̱ kuru nuwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Diga o umatsun wa Maki azagbain a̱ a̱soja a̱ cipa̱i a̱ ta̱wa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">waru diga ya̱ Zebulun aza a na a̱ ri uguzu na aaɗanga a yali ya̱ a̱soja.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Azagbain a Isaka o to oɓolo na̱ Debora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">amayun, Isaka to oɓolo na̱ Barak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">o toni yi ta̱ ni ilaɗi a̱ tyo o uka̱ri'i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Amma ugundo wa̱ Roben u ne'eshen ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ le a̱ ta̱ shi.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Adama a̱ nye yi isawain oɓolo no oɓolo e ikyon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">adama yu uwwa i'ulu adama o oɓolo e le?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Amayun ugundo wa̱ Roben u ne'eshen ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ le a̱ ta̱ shi.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Ugundo wa Gadu wi isawan ta̱ asana o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">Nye i zuwai ugundo wa Dan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">wi isawain uba̱ta̱ wa antsun?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Asha waru isawan ta̱ a̱ nge'en m mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">e isawan ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u na antsun e isawusan.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Amma ama a̱ Zebulun a ca ta̱ wuma u le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:18">ne ɗa waru ama a Nafutali uba̱ta̱ wu uvon.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />&lt;&lt;Ngono n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a yuwan ta̱ uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">ngono ma Ka'ana a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a yuwan uvon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">ɗe Ta'ana, a̱ nge'en mu uɗolu wa Megido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">agba a̱ pura̱ itana i azurufa shi.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Italyo'o i yuwan ta̱ uvon ɗe zuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:20">ele a paɗalasa, a yuwan ta̱ uvon na̱ Sisera.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Uɗolu wa̱ Kishon u lyuwa le ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">a̱yi akuci o uɗolu, Uɗolu wa̱ Kishon.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:21" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:21">&lt;&lt;Lyuwa elime wuma u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">vu kapanu!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />&lt;&lt;Reve ido yu ucira ya Sisera i uwa ilaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ o ka̱vurusa̱ iɗa no okotsu e le.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma damma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">&lt;Yuwaan lyuci va Mero una̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">Vu yuwaan ama a̱ yi una̱ u vama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">adama a na a̱ ta̱wa̱ a kamba A̱sulazuva shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">a kamba A̱sulazuva uvon oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ o uvon o ucira a̱ yi shi.&gt;<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />&lt;&lt;Ka na la'ai aba'un a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱yi ɗa Jaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">ka va Heba za va Keni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:24">za na la'ai akapi a̱ a̱ma̱ci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ o ogodo aba'un.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisera pati ta̱ mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">a̱vu u ca yi maani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:25">a yanda i na yi ntsayi a ca azagbain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">reve u ca yi maani ma̱ a̱ga̱ɓa̱.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />U canana ta̱ ukere wa̱ yi u tara rumu ma̱shuwa̱ mo oogodo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi u ɗa u guza̱i ma̱ka̱ta̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">A̱vu u ga̱la̱a̱ Sisera, a̱vu wu ɓoso yi aaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">reve u mura yi aaci u tusula niyi kengi vu utsuvu.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />E memere ma ana a̱ yi a ɗa u liɓai e iɗa, u riya̱i, u voyin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">E memere ma ana a̱ yi a ɗa u liɓai, u riya̱i.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">Uba̱ta̱ u na u liɓai, lo ɗa u riya̱ u kuwa̱i.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Mma va Sisera indana ta̱ iɗa nu usowoto wu upepu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">wi indana ta̱ nu uba̱ta̱ wi irumu i na i geshei usowoto wu upepu, u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">&lt;Adama a̱ nye keke vi ido ya̱ yi jimai babu na u ka̱mba̱i?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">Adama a̱ nye ilama yi ido ya̱ yi i ka̱mba̱i keɗu shi?&gt;<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />A̱ma̱ci a na a la'ai ugbozu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na aa kambusa yi ulinga, a̱ usu yi ta̱;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">amayun gba u lyuwa ta̱ elime a dansaa aciya̱yi,<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />&lt;Ele a zamishi a̱vu waru e ne'eshishen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">itana i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">usheli u ta̱ ko ejere adama a vuma ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">a̱tugu a sa'ani a wukalu adama a Sisera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">a̱tugu a sa'ani na̱ a̱za̱ o uɗavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">na̱ a̱tugu a wukalu adama a̱ va̱.&gt;<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva, lyawa n'yuwatan ma̱ wu suru n koto, tsa̱ Sisera!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">Amma lyawa aza a na a ciga nuwu a̱ 'yon a̱tsuma̱ o ucira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">cine urana u tsu uta̱!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">A̱vu iɗa'a yi ivuwan nu uvon hali a'wan amunga.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɗewu va Gidiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Reve gba aza a Isra'ila a yuwisan ili i iwuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a ca nle e ekere a aza a Midiya hali a'wan e cindere. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Reve aza a Midiya a lyuwa ucira wa aza a Isra'ila. Adama o ndolo reve aza a Isra'ila a suma a zamiya aciyele uba̱ta̱ u na a̱a̱ da̱na̱ a pa'asan a̱ a̱ba̱nu oɓolo na̱ ba̱ta̱ ro a nsasan. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila a yuwain ca̱'a̱n suru, reve aza a Midiya na aza a Amaleka na akapi a ama diga asana, a̱ ta̱wa̱ a fara uvon ne ele. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Reve a̱ va̱la̱ e iɗa'a, reve a̱ lungusa̱ ca̱'a̱n na aza a Isra'ila a̱ cu'wa̱in hali a̱ tyo Gaza. A lyawaa aza a Isra'ila ili i na aa lyuwa shi ko ke'en, ko a lyawaa le ikyon ko inan ko nloli shi. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Adama a na a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ no oɓolo e iliyamunga i le no ogodo cine vu revei oɓolo a apapari. U ri n yuwan a gura kece ama oɓolo na arakumi e le shi. A mantsa ma na suru a uwai e iɗa'a a̱ tsu lungusa̱ yi ta̱. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Aza a Isra'ila o o'wo ta̱ nu ulambu lon adama a aza a Midiya. Ɗaɗa e showeyin A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Ana aza a Isra'ila e showeyin A̱sulazuva adama aza a Midiya, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />u lyunguwa̱ ta̱ aza a Isra'ila na̱ vumava̱sula̱. Reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, a dammai: Mu uta̱a̱ ɗu ta̱ diga e iɗa ya Masar, e iɗa i tsugbashi. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />N wawa ɗu ta̱ e ekere aza a Masar ne ekere aza a na a̱ shi a tsugba nɗu suru, a̱vu n lo le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu, a̱vu n ca ɗu iɗa i le. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />A̱vu n damma ɗu, &lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. She i yuwaan musula̱ ma aza a Amoriya a̱ga̱nda̱ aza a na i ri nden e iɗa i le wan.&gt; Amma i zuwaa mu atsuvu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />A̱vu malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ ta̱wa̱ ma̱ da̱nu e ikyun yu uɗanga u gbain wa̱ Jowash za va Abiyeza a̱tsuma̱ a Ofura. A mantsa mo ndolo Gidiyon ulobo wa̱ Jowash u da̱na̱ ta̱ a fabusa oroci a yitabo uba̱ta̱ u na o kpokuso masayan ma̱ ina̱bi adama u sokoo aza a Midiya. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ roco aciya̱yi ya Gidiyon reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, a̱vu vuma gbain ɗa na gurai uvon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Reve Gidiyon usu yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri, zagbain va̱, na̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu, cine tsu ri na addama a̱ a̱bunda̱? Te ɗa suru ili ya asalama i na nkaya n tsu n damma ntsu? A damma tsu ta̱ cine A̱sulazuva o uta̱a̱ nle a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Masar. A̱yi ɗa nda gba gogo u vari ntsu, reve u ca tsu e ekere a aza a Midiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Reve A̱sulazuva a vadala uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi reve u damma, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o ucira u na n ca nuwu, tsa̱ra̱ vu wawa aza a Isra'ila e ekere a aza a Midiya. A̱mu ɗa ma̱a̱ lyungusu wu shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Reve Gidiyon usu yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri, zagbain va̱, cine maa wawa aza a Isra'ila? Umatsun u tsu ele ɗa a̱ ri babu ucira suru suru a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa Manase, waru ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱mu ɗa mawun a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Na amayun n ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, vu to kototo aza a Midiya suru, she damma vuma ta̱ ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Reve Gidiyon damma yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ n tsura̱ isa'ani e ekere a̱ wu gogo, to, vu roco mu iroci a na a̱vu ɗa na amayun vu yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱mu. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Yuwan ankuri she vu ka̱ra̱ wan, she na̱ n ta̱wa̱ na̱ kucci va̱, a̱vu n zuwa yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;N to puro wu hali vu ka̱mba̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />A̱vu Gidiyon ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, a̱vu u foɓo meggbele, a̱vu waru u yuwan opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi a yira i lashi makundatsu kupa ne ejere. Reve u zuwa inama a asaka na̱ mayan o upondo, reve wu uta̱ ne ele reve u ca malingata'a kucci le e ikyun yu uɗanga u gbain.<verse eid="JDG 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />A̱vu malingata'a ma damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu tara inama'a oɓolo no opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi, a̱vu vu zuwa le a aatali a nda, a̱vu vu tsuwa̱n le mayan.&gt;&gt; A̱vu u yuwan tsu ndolo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />A̱vu malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma canana aaɗanga a mmalu a na a̱ da̱na̱i o ukere wa̱ yi, a̱vu u ju'wa̱n inama'a no opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi na̱ combo va aaɗanga'a. A̱vu akina o uta̱ ɗe a aatali'i u kula̱to inama'a oɓolo na opopofu'u suru. A̱vu malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ puwa̱n yi. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Ana Gidiyon ta̱wa̱ revei a na malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma ɗa, a̱vu u saala, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva Zagbain! Wawawa! Me ene ta̱ malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva esu ne esu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a damma niyi, &lt;&lt;Vu da̱na̱ na asuvu nden! She vu uwwa wovon wan. Va̱a̱ kuwa̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Ɗaɗa Gidiyon suwayi A̱sulazuva masa'a lo, a̱vu u ɗe yi A̱sulazuva a ɗa Asuvu Nden. Hali na ana'an ne ɗa u ri, masa'a'a ma̱ ta̱ lo a Ofura va aza a Abiyeza.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />A̱tsuma̱ a ayin o ndolo a ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai Gidiyon, &lt;&lt;Vu tara oogono a nan e ire a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo a dada va̱ wu, za na rawai a'wan e cindere. Vu varu musa'a ma Ba'al aza a dada va̱ wu, reve waru vu gasa a̱a̱shuwutsu a̱ a̱ma̱li a ka Ashera za na ri zuzu na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Reve vu suwa masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu zuva va aganga a nda, na atali ugeru cine wu ntsayi. Vu tara oogono a nan e ire reve vu yuwaan kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ a̱yi na̱ ɗanga va̱ a̱a̱shuwutsu a Ashera a na vu gasai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Gidiyon tara ta̱ ama kupa a̱tsuma̱ a agbashi a̱ yi, a̱vu u yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi. Amma adama a na waa uwwusa wovon wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi oɓolo na ama a̱ lyuci'i, u yuwan nu urana shi, she na ayin.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Ana ama a̱ lyuci'i a juwain na̱ wasasa, a̱vu a cina a̱yi ɗa nda gba o ɓosoi masa'a ma Ba'al! Reve o koɗo a̱a̱shuwutsu a Ashera a na a̱ da̱na̱i zuzu na̱ a̱yi, ɗaɗa a cayi kucci vo oogono e ire a masa'a ma sa'avu ma na a suwai.<verse eid="JDG 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />A̱vu e ecelei, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa yuwain ulinga u nda?&gt;&gt; Ana a zamiyi ben, ɗaɗa a damma nle, &lt;&lt;Gidiyon ulobo wa Jowash ɗa za vu ulinga'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />A̱vu a̱za̱ a̱ lyuci'i a damma Jowash, &lt;&lt;Uta̱a̱ nu ulobo wa̱ wu tsa̱ra̱ tsu una yi, adama a na wu mura ta̱ masa'a ma Ba'al reve wu koɗo a̱a̱shuwutsu a Ashera a na a̱ ri zuzu na̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Amma Jowash damma ta̱ aza a na a cigai a yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi suru, &lt;&lt;I ta̱ usuwa̱ Ba'al? Ko i ta wawa yi? Za na suru usuwa̱ niyi a̱ to una yi nu usana. Na̱ a̱yi ma̱sula̱ ma ɗa na amayun, lyawa u yuwaan aciya̱yi nla̱ngi, adama a na a murai masa'a ma̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />O urana u ndolo u ɗa e ɗeyi Gidiyon Jeruba'al, a na, &lt;&lt;Lyawa Ba'al yuwaan aciya̱yi nla̱ngi,&gt;&gt; adama a na wu ɓosoi masa'a ma Ba'al.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Ana ili i ndolo i kotoi, reve aza a Midiya suru, oɓolo na aza a Amaleka, na akapi a ama diga asana o ɓoloto, reve a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu reve a̱ va̱la̱ o Uka̱ri wa Yezireyel. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Reve Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva cipa̱a̱ Gidiyon nu ucira, ɗaɗa wi ivula̱i aavana tsa̱ ɗesu adama o uvon, ɗaɗa ali o umatsun wa Abiyeza a̱ ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Reve u lyungu nlingata a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Manase suru, e ɗesu le ta̱ a̱vu o ɓoloto o toni yi. Reve waru u lyungu nlingata a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Asha na̱ Zebulun na̱ Nafutali. Reve fo a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsa̱ra̱ a ga'an na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Reve Gidiyon damma A̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;Na amayun a ɗa vu ta wawa aza a Isra'ila nu ukere u va̱ cine vu yuwain nzuwulai, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />gogo n to polo ukwan wu kyon o osoroto. Nu usana u tawa, na̱ n cina a'iza o ukwan goon, iɗa waru u'yewu, ɗaɗa mee reve a na vu ta wawa aza a Isra'ila nu ukere u va̱ cine vu dammai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Ne ɗa ili'i i farai. Ana Gidiyon 'yoyin na̱ wasasa, reve u kpoko ukwa'an reve yanda'a i shiwan na̱ mini'i.<verse eid="JDG 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Reve Gidiyon damma A̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri, she vu yuwan upan na̱ a̱mu wan. Vu lyawa mu n da̱shi pati uta̱ goon. Lyawa n da̱shi rito nu ukwa'an. Gogo lyawa ukwa'an u da̱na̱ u'yewu reve iɗa'a i da̱na̱ ure'u na a'iza ma̱ɓula̱ ma̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Na ayin o ndolo, reve A̱sula̱ a yuwan cine Gidiyon patiyi. Ukwa'an goon u da̱na̱ ta̱ u'yewu, iɗa'a gba ma̱ɓula̱ ma̱ yi ure'u na a'iza.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidiyon lyuwa ta̱ aza a Midiya nu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Reve Jeruba'al za na a̱yi ɗa Gidiyon na ali o uvon a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi suru a̱ 'yon na̱ wasasa, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu ne esu a̱ mini a Haro. Aza a Midiya a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ uva̱lu upasu wu ugana ne ele o uka̱ri zuzu na̱ Masasan ma̱ More. <verse eid="JDG 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Gidiyon, &lt;&lt;A̱za̱ o uvon a na vu ri ne ele a la'a ta̱ a̱bunda̱ lon a na maa ca aza a Midiya e ekere e le, ta̱wa̱ aza a Isra'ila a yuwaan mu uvaɗu a damma, &lt;Ucira u tsu u ɗa u wawa ntsu&gt; wan. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Gogo damma ama'a, &lt;Vuma na uwwai wovon suru a̱vu u je'en lipu u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, u lyawa Masasan ma Giliyadu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Masasan ma Giliyadu. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">&lt;&lt;Giliyadu&gt;&gt; ta yuwusan adanshi o upasu u na u ri asana o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, amma pa nda u ta yuwusan adanshi o uba̱ta̱ zuzu nu uka̱ri wa̱ Jeziriye a̱livu a̱ Urudu'u.</char></note> Reve ama ukpakukupa ushin ne ejere (22,000) a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa, a̱vu ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) e isawan.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Gidiyon, &lt;&lt;Hali n gogo vu ta̱ na̱ ali o uvon a na a la'ai a̱bunda̱ lon. Tara le a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ esu a̱ mini'i, n ta ɗangulaa wu ele ɗe. Na̱ n damma, &lt;Vuma nda ta 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu,&gt; u ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱. Amma na̱ n damma, &lt;A̱yi ndeɗe a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ na̱ a̱vu shi,&gt; wa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Ɗaɗa Gidiyon tarai ali o uvo'on a̱ tyo a̱ mini'i. Reve A̱sulazuva a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ne'eshen ali o uvo'on ba̱ta̱ re. Oɓolo a̱ ta̱ aza a na o sowoi mini tsa̱ musa̱n suru. Oɓolo e ire aza a na a̱ kingyoi suru, reve o sowo mini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Ali o uvon ukpakuta'atsu (300) goon ɗa e kenei mini ne ekere e le reve o sowo tsa̱ musa̱n. Akapi gba shi suru, a̱ kingyo ta̱ reve o sowo mini.<verse eid="JDG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Gidiyon, &lt;&lt;Na ama ukpakuta'atsu (300) a nda aza a na o sowoi tsa̱ musa̱'a̱n n ta wawa ɗu n ca aza a Midiya e ekere a̱ ɗu. Damma akapi a ama, vuma suru u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Reve Gidiyon zuwa akapi ali o uvon a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mba̱ o ogodo e le, amma a̱vu u lyawa ali o uvon ukpakuta'atsu (300) oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, aza a na a̱ ushiyi ilyalya na avana a akapi a ama'a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:8">Uva̱la̱ta̱ wa aza a Midiya gba u da̱na̱ ta̱ za̱la̱ ne ele o uka̱ri'i. <verse eid="JDG 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Na ayin o ndolo, reve A̱sulazuva a damma Gidiyon,&lt;&lt;'Yon, 'ya̱wa̱ tsa̱ra̱ vu riya̱a̱ aza a Midiya nu uvon, adama a na n ca wu ta̱ ɗe ele e ekere a̱ wu. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Amma na̱ vaa uwwusa wovon u na va̱a̱ riya̱a̱ le nu uvon, vu 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ Pura za na aa ɓanasaa wu itana yu uvon. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Vu uwwa ili i na aza a Midiya a̱ da̱na̱ a dansa. Na̱ a̱yi ndolo koto, vu ta̱ tsura̱ okolo o ugbamu a na va̱a̱ riya̱a̱ uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱ nu uvon.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Gidiyon oɓolo na̱ Pura za na aa ɓanasaa yi itana yu uvon a rawa a̱ nge'en mu uva̱la̱ta̱ wu n'yuwatan uba̱ta̱ u na ali o uvon a̱ ri e ipiri. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />A̱vu aza a Midiya na aza a Amaleka oɓolo na ama diga asana suru a̱ da̱nu o uka̱ri tso oɓolo a apapari. Aa gura kece arakumi e le shi, adama a na a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱bunda̱ cine vu revei wuyun wu nge'en m mala.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Ana Gidiyon rawai, a̱vu wu uwwa vuma ro a dansaa za̱ va̱ yi alavu a na u yuwain. U da̱na̱ ta̱ a dansa, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ alavu. Me ene ta̱ a̱a̱kutsu o oopopofu a na a yuwain na̱ yitabo a gandaluwusa a̱ tyo o uva̱la̱ta̱ u tsu. A̱vu u gama oogodo nu ucira, hali oogodoꞌo u ganlyuwa a̱vu u riya̱ e iɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />A̱vu za̱ yi'i u usu, &lt;&lt;Ili i ro i ɗa shi u ka̱ra̱i matsun me pe'eni ma Gidiyon ulobo wa Jowash, vuma va Isra'ila. A̱sula̱ a ca ta̱ ɗe aza a Midiya oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ tsu suru e ekere a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Ana Gidiyon uwwai adama a alavu'u nu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi, a̱vu u von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ u yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱. A̱vu u ka̱mba̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila a̱vu u saala, &lt;&lt;'Yoyin! A̱sulazuva a ca ta̱ ɗe oɓolo aza a Midiya e ekere a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Reve u ne'eshen ama ukpakuta'atsu (300) oɓolo a ta'atsu, reve waru u ca za suru aavana na̱ meden na aakata a akina pe.<verse eid="JDG 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;I ka̱lyuwa̱ mu. Na̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ nge'en mu uva̱la̱ta̱ ma aza a Midiya, i yuwan ununa n yuwain suru. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Na̱ a̱mu na ama a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱mu tsi ivula̱ avana a̱ tsu, reve a̱ɗu fo yi ivula̱ avana a̱ ɗu a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ mu uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱ suru. Reve i salaa, &lt;Adama a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ Gidiyon.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Gidiyon na ama ukpaku (100) a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a rawa a̱ nge'en mo o uva̱la̱ta̱ ma aza a Midiya na ayin uɓatsu, a mantsa ma na a vadalai a̱za̱ e ipiri gan. Reve e ivula̱ avana, reve waru o ɓoso muden n na a̱ ri ne ele e ekere e le. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Ɗaɗa oɓolo a ta'atsu'u suru e ivula̱i avana'a a̱vu o ɓoso mude'en. A̱vu a̱ guza̱ akata a akina e le o ukere ugula̱, avana gba o ukere usa'ani u na ee ivula̱. Reve a saala, &lt;&lt;Matsun me pe'eni adama a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ Gidiyon!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Reve vuma suru isawan uba̱ta̱ u na u ri a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱. Reve aza a Midiya suru a suma a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ a yisaali na̱ wovon reve a suma.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Mantsa ma na a za a Isra'ila ukpakuta'atsu (300) e ivula̱i avana e le, reve A̱sulazuva a zuwa n'yuwatan n le n ka̱ra̱ a yuwusan nla̱ngi va̱ni le na̱ matsun me pe'eni a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ suru. Akapi a ama a na gba o unai shi, reve a suma a̱ tyo Bet Shita zuzu na̱ Zerera, ozo o ro waru gba a suma a̱ tyo Abel Mehola, zuzu na̱ Taba.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />A̱vu e ɗe aza a Isra'ila diga o ugundo wa Nafutali nu ugundo wa Asha, oɓolo waru nu ugundo wa Manase suru, a̱vu o uta̱ a saɓa aza a Midiya. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />A̱vu gba Gidiyon lyungu nlingata e iɗa ya agaɗi a Ifiramu suru u damma, &lt;&lt;Zura̱i a̱cipa̱ za̱la̱, i yuwan uvon na aza a Midiya, a̱vu i usa upasata wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu na̱ a̱za̱ ɗolu hali a̱ tyo Bet Bara.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:24">Ɗaɗa e ɗeyi ama a Ifiramu suru, a̱vu a usa upasata wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu na̱ a̱za̱ ɗolu hali a̱ tyo Bet Bara. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />A̱vu waru e reme azagbain e re a aza a Midiya, Ore na̱ Zeye. A̱vu o una Ore a aatali a Ore, a̱vu waru o una Zeye uba̱ta̱ u na o kpokuso masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ɗe Zeye. A̱vu a lyuwa elime na̱ masaɓa ma aza a Midiya a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ Gidiyon na aaci a Ore na̱ Zeye, uba̱ta̱ u na u shi asana nu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Gidiyon una ta̱ Zeba na̱ Zalumuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Reve aza a Ifiramu ece Gidiyon, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu yuwan ntsu tsunda? Nye i zuwai vu ɗe ntsu a na va̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon na aza a Midiya shi?&gt;&gt; A̱vu a yuwan mawasan ma̱ a̱bunda̱ na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Reve gba u usu le, &lt;&lt;Ili i ne i ɗa n yuwain ana a kurato na̱ za na i yuwain? U'yanlu wa Ifiramu wu umatsun ina̱bi u la'a ugasa wu umatsun ina̱bi va amayun wu umatsun u ke'en wa Abiyeza shi? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />A̱sula̱ a ca ta̱ ɗe Ore na̱ Zeye azagbain a Midiya e ekere a̱ ɗu. Ili i ne i ɗa n gura yuwain ana a kurato na̱ za na i yuwain?&gt;&gt; Ana u yuwain adanshi o ndolo, a̱vu upan u le a aci a̱ yi u von.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />A̱vu Gidiyon oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ yi ukpakuta'atsu (300) a lyuwa elime na̱ masaɓa ma n'yuwatan n le ko na a̱ shi a̱ kuna̱i ɗe, a̱vu a̱ rawa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱vu a pasa yi. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />A̱vu u damma ama a Suko, &lt;&lt;Yuwain ankuri, cayi ali o uvon a̱ va̱ ilyalya, adama a na a̱ ta̱ ukunu, a̱yi ɗa nda m buwa ta̱ e itoni ya Zeba na̱ Zalumuna, ngono ma Midiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Amma a̱vu azagbain a Suko a damma, &lt;&lt;Koto vu reme Zeba na̱ Zalumuna e ekere a̱ wu ne'en shi, cine tsa ɗa tsaa ca ali o uvon a̱ wu ilyalya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />A̱vu Gidiyon usu, &lt;&lt;To, mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva a cayi Zeba na̱ Zalumuna e ekere a̱ va̱, n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ m ɓuɓatsa lipu ɗu na awanda o una.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Diga lo a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Penuwe, a̱vu u yuwan adanshi ne ele cine u yuwain ɗe, a̱vu gba aza a Penuwe a̱ usu yi cine ama a Suko a̱ usu niyi. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />A̱vu u damma aza a Penuwe, &lt;&lt;Na̱ n ka̱mba̱ waru nu ulyuwu wa aci, n to ɓoso aatsura a nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Gogo Zeba oɓolo na̱ Zalumuna a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ Karko oɓolo na̱ ali o uvon e le, ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa uton (15,000), aza a na a buwai suru a̱tsuma̱ a ali o uvon diga asana. Ele ɗa ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa ushin (120,000) aza a na o unai ɗe na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Ɗaɗa Gidiyon tsu toni nu ure u na u toniyi nu ure wa aza a aguɓa, za na ri asana a Noba na̱ Yogbeha, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱a̱ a̱soja a Midiya nu uvon babu ele ufoɓu. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Zeba na̱ Zalumuna ngono n re ma Midiya a suma ta̱, ɗaɗa gba u toni nle a̱vu u reme le. A̱vu u zuwa a̱soja suru a uwwa wovon.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />A̱vu Gidiyon ulobo wa Jowash u ka̱mba̱ diga ɗe uba̱ta̱ wu uvon nu ugawun wu ure wa Here. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />A̱vu u reme molobo mo Suko a̱vu u yuwan yi yeci. A̱vu molobo'o ma ɗanaa yi ala a azagbain na̱ mbara ma Suko, ama kupocindere na̱ a̱za̱ e cindere. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />A̱vu u ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama o Suko reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;To, apa Zeba na̱ Zalumuna aza a na i yuwaan numu ulamu adama e le, adansa, &lt;Koto vu reme Zeba na̱ Zalumuna e ekere a̱ wu ne'en shi, cine tsa ɗa tsaa ca ali a̱ wu a na a̱ ri ukunu ilyalya?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />A̱vu Gidiyon tara mbara n lyuci'i a̱vu u ca le a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na awanda o una. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />A̱vu wu ɓoso atsura a Penuwe a̱vu wu una ama a̱ lyuci'i.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />A̱vu we ece Zeba na̱ Zalumuna, &lt;&lt;Cu'un va ama a̱ ne ɗa yu unai ɗe Tabo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Ama icu'un ya̱ wu. Suru nle o rotso ta̱ muwun mu ngono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Reve Gidiyon usu, &lt;&lt;Ele muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun n va̱ n ɗa, muwun ma mma va̱ n ɗa! N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, na̱ shi yu una le shi, n shi o una ɗu fo shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />A̱vu u damma Jete, mawun mo ufaru ma̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Una le!&gt;&gt; Amma u tala matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi shi adama a na u buwai mawun waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ a uwwusa wovon.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />A̱vu Zeba na̱ Zalumuna a damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱, vu una tsu na aciya̱wu. Adama a na she na̱ vuma rawa vali ɗaɗa waa yuwan ulinga u vali.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Gidiyon 'yon a̱vu wu una le, a̱vu u ba̱ɗa̱ itana i sa'ani yi ikebe a̱ yinlu ya arakumi e le.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱a̱ma̱li a Gidiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a damma Gidiyon, &lt;&lt;Vu yuwan tsugbain a aci a̱ tsu, a̱vu nu ulobo wa̱ wu na̱ mawun ma tsukaya ma̱ wu mo ulobo adama a na vu wawa ntsu e ekere aza a Midiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Amma a̱vu Gidiyon damma le, &lt;&lt;Maa yuwan tsugbain a aci a̱ ɗu shi, ko ulobo u va̱ shi. A̱sulazuva a ɗa a yuwan tsugbain a aci a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />A̱vu u lyuwa elime na adanshi u damma, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ ni ipati e ekere a̱ ɗu, suru nɗu i ca mu iliyatsuvu i ta̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon.&gt;&gt; Adama a na aza a Midiya aza a Isma'ila a ɗa, waru agadu a aza Isma'ila a ɗa u'otosu wi iliyatsuvu i zinariya.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta ca wu ele na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱!&gt;&gt; A̱vu o polo a̱tugu e iɗa, a̱vu vuma suru vari ɗe iliyatsuvu a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Ume wi iliyatsuvu i zinariya i na Gidiyon patiyi u ta rawa kilo ushin, babu ni itana i sa'ani yi ikebe, oɓolo ni iliyinlu, na̱ amuna a na a yuwain na̱ mini ma̱ ma̱ɗiya̱ aza a na ngono ma Midiya mo otosu, ni iliyinlu i na o otosu arakumi a̱ yinlu. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Ɗaɗa gba Gidiyon yuwain a̱a̱ma̱li a zinariya, a̱vu u zuwa yi a Ofura, a̱ lyuci va̱ yi. A̱vu ama Isra'ila suru a yuwan tsushakala o ure u na a yuwusain a̱a̱ma̱li o ndolo a̱ga̱nda̱. Ili i ndolo yo o'wo ta̱ maza a̱ tyo ya Gidiyon nu umatsun wa̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Ne ɗa aza a Isra'ila a lyuwai aci a aza a Midiya, adama o ndolo a̱ da̱shi zami le adanshi waru shi. A mantsa ma wuma wa Gidiyon iɗa'a yi ivuwan ta̱ nu uvon hali a'wan amunga.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa Gidiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Reve Jeruba'al za na a̱yi ɗa Gidiyon ulobo wa̱ Jowash u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi na̱ nden. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidiyon da̱na̱ ta̱ no olobo kupocindere aza a aciya̱yi, adama a na u da̱na̱i na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Ka vu nge'en va̱ yi za na da̱na̱i Shekem, u matsaan yi ta̱ fo ulobo, za na Gidiyon cayi aala Abimele. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />A̱vu Gidiyon ulobo wa̱ Jowash kuwa̱ cina u kutsa lon a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi a aason a̱ Jowash dada va̱ yi, ɗe Ofura va aza a Abiyeza.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />A jima shi ana Gidiyon kuwa̱i, a̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mbisa̱ a yuwusan tsushakala a yuwusaan a̱ma̱li a Ba'al a̱ga̱nda̱. A̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱to Ba'al Beri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ba'al Beri </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda aala &lt;&lt;Ba'al Beri&gt;&gt; urevu wa̱ yi u ɗa &lt;&lt;Zagbain vu nzuwulai.&gt;&gt;</char></note> ma̱sula̱ me ele. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Reve e icina na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le, za na wawa nle e ekere a n'yuwatan n le suru, aza a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />A̱vu waru a̱ kuɗa̱ o roco u'wa wa Jeruba'al za na a̱yi ɗa Gidiyon isa'ani ya amayun, suru ni isa'ani i na u yuwaan nle.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimele yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa Shekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Urana u ro a̱vu Abimele ulobo wa̱ Jeru Ba'al, u 'ya̱wa̱ Shekem uba̱ta̱ wi imaci ya mma va̱ yi a̱vu u damma le oɓolo nu ugundo wa mma va̱ yi suru, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />&lt;&lt;N te ipati i ɗu, i pati azagbain a Shekem, i damma le, &lt;Ili i ne i ɗa i la'aa nɗu ulobonu, a damma olobo a Jeru Ba'al kupocindere suru a yuwan tsugbain tsa̱ ɗu ko a damma vuma ta̱ yuwan tsugbain tsa̱ ɗu?&gt; Agba i cuwan a̱mu lipu na̱ mpasa n ɗu n ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />A̱vu a̱za̱ o ugundo wa mma va Abimele a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ azagbain a Shekem na adanshi a nda. Ɗaɗa okolo a azagbain a̱ ka̱mba̱i uba̱ta̱ wa Abimele reve a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱yi za tsu ɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />A̱vu a ca yi azurufa kupocindere diga a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u ma̱sula̱ ma Ba'al Beri za na Abimele yuwayin ulinga u kopoi a̱za̱ o ugbawu ama a vama ne ele, reve ele gba a̱ kuru yi. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />A̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi a Ofura a̱vu wu una a̱za̱ a̱ yi kupocindere zuva va aatali a̱ ta̱, olobo a Jeru Ba'al. Amma Jotam ulobo wu ukosu wa Jeru Ba'al, u la'a ta̱ adama a na u sokoyi aciya̱yi. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />A̱vu azagbain a Shekem na aza a Bet Milo suru o ɓoloto zuzu nu uɗanga wo Oku uba̱ta̱ wa aatali a gbain a̱tsuma̱ a Shekem adama a katala Abimele mogono.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Ana a dammai Jotam aɗa a nda, a̱vu u kumba a̱ ncilecile m Masasan ma Gerizim a̱vu u saala le, &lt;&lt;I zuwaa mu atsuvu a̱ɗu azagbain a Shekem, adama A̱sula̱ o poloo ɗu atsuvu. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Urana u ro ɗanga vu uta̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ a katalaa aciyele mogono. A̱vu a damma uɗanga u zetun, &lt;Voo o'wo tsu mogono.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />&lt;&lt;Reve uɗanga u zetun u usu, &lt;Mi icina na̱ mani'in ma na maa casu, uba̱ta̱ u na musula̱ na ama suru a̱ tsu tsura̱ tsugbain, a̱vu n 'ya̱wa̱ n reme mpolo na̱ ɗanga?&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗanga'a a damma uɗanga wu ubiri, &lt;Ta̱wa̱ vo o'wo tsu mogono.&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />&lt;&lt;Agba a̱vu uɗanga wu ubiri u usu, &lt;N lyawa a casu muwun mu uɗanga n va̱, aza a na a̱ ri ulobonu na̱ a̱limu, a̱vu n ta̱wa̱ n reme mpolo na̱ ɗanga?&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗanga damma ataci, &lt;Ta̱wa̱ vo o'wo tsu mogono.&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu ataci a̱ usu, &lt;N lyawa masayan ma sa'avu ma̱ va̱, za na aa casu musula̱ na ama ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱vu n ta̱wa̱ n reme mpolo na̱ ɗanga?&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />&lt;&lt;A̱ tyo o ukosu, a̱vu ɗanga suru a damma awanda o una, &lt;Ta̱wa̱ vo o'wo tsu mogono.&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu awanda o una a damma ɗanga, &lt;Ni i ciga ta̱ na amayun i katala mu mogono a aci a̱ ɗu, ta̱wa̱i i pa'an o ululu u va̱, na̱ ne ɗa shi, lyawa akina o uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a awanda o una u kula̱to ɗanga sida va Lebanon.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Ɗaɗa Jotam dammai, &lt;&lt;Gogo, i yuwan ta̱ mejege na amayun a na i katalai Abimele mogono ma̱ ɗu? To, i yuwaan ta̱ Jeru Ba'al nu umatsun wa̱ yi a̱ɓula̱? A̱yi ndolo ɗa atsupu o ulinga wa̱ yi? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />I cuwan na dada va̱ yuwain uvon adama a̱ ɗu. U ca ta̱ wuma wa̱ yi adama u wawa ɗu e ekere aza a Midiya. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Amma ana'an gba a̱ɗu ɗa nda i vadalai a yuwusan nla̱ngi nu umatsun wa dada va̱. Reve yu una olobo a̱ yi kupocindere zuva va aatali a̱ ta̱. A̱vu i katala Abimele ulobo wa aagbashi o usheli, wo o'wo mogono ma aza a Shekem, adama a na a̱yi maci ɗu ɗa. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Gogo tsunda, ni ili i na i yuwayin Jeru Ba'al nu umatsun wa̱ yi mejege ma ɗa na amayun ana'an, to, i za̱nga̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ Abimele, a̱yi waru u yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu! <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Na̱ ne ɗa gba shi, lyawa akina o uta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Abimele u lyuwa ɗu, azagbain a Shekem na̱ Bet Milo, lyawa akina o uta̱ uba̱ta̱ u ɗu, a̱ɗu aza a Shekem na̱ Bet Milo, u lyuwa Abimele!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />A̱vu Jotam suma u la'a a̱ tyo Biya a̱vu u da̱nu ɗe, adama a na u ta uwwusa wovon u mawun ma̱ a̱sha̱wu ma̱ yi Abimele.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimele yuwan ta̱ a'wan a ta'atsu a yuwusan tsugbain tsa Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />A̱vu A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ tsushu'un tsa vama e ekere a Abimele na azagbain a Shekem, a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n yi aci. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Ili i ndolo i fara ta̱ adama a tsupa wunu u na o unai olobo kupocindere a Jeru Ba'al, waru mpasa n le n da̱na̱ ta̱ a aci a Abimele na a aci a azagbain a Shekem aza a na a kamba niyi mona ma̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Reve azagbain a Shekem a zuwa ama a̱ vawan ɗe zuva vu nsasan, a̱vu a usa itana ya ama a na a̱ ri a̱ ka̱ra̱sa̱ le lo uba̱ta̱'a̱. A̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ Abimele aɗa.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />A̱vu Ga'al ulobo wa Ebe u uwa pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Shekem oɓolo ni imaci ya̱ yi, a̱vu azagbain a Shekem a zuwaa yi ucira. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Ana a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i o uɗuma̱, a̱vu o ɓoloto limatan va̱ ina̱bi, a̱vu o kpoko le, ɗaɗa a yuwain a̱buki a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u ma̱sula̱ ma̱ le. A̱vu a lyuwa o sowo reve waru e isululai Abimele. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />A̱vu Ga'al ulobo wa Ebe u damma, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa Abimele, waru zane ɗa Shekem, a na tsa yuwaan yi tsugbashi? A̱yi ulobo wa Jeru Ba'al ɗa shi? Waru a̱yi Zebu kambi va̱ yi ɗa shi? Yuwayin ama a Hamo tsugbashi, dada va Shekem! Adama a̱ nye i ɗa tsaa yuwaan Abimele tsugbashi? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />A damma ama a nda a̱ ta̱ za̱la̱ vu ucira u va̱, n shi ta̱ a tawa yi! N shi ta̱ a damma Abimele, &lt;Vu da̱shi a̱bunda̱ a̱ a̱soja a̱ wu, reve vu uta̱ vu yuwan uvon.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Ana Zebu zagbain lyuci'i wu uwwai ili i na Ga'al ulobo wa Ebe u dammai, u yuwan ta̱ upan lon. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Reve u lyunguwa̱ Abimele na̱ nlingata a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Aruma, adansa, &lt;&lt;Amayun, Ga'al ulobo wa Ebe ni imaci ya̱ yi a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ Shekem, waru a ta zuwusa a̱za̱ a̱ lyuci'i a̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n wu ugbozu. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Gogo she vu 'yon a̱tsuma̱ a ayin a nda, oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ wu, i vawan a̱tsuma̱ a atsusa. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Reve nu usana, na̱ mota̱a̱ mo urana, vu reme uvon na̱ lyuci'i. Mantsa ma na Ga'al na ali o uvon a̱ yi o uta̱i tsa̱ra̱ a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱vu, reve vu yuwan ne ele ili i na ve enei u lobono ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Reve Abimele oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ yi suru a̱ 'yon na ayin, a̱vu a vawan a̱tsuma̱ o ogozo zuzu na̱ Shekem oɓolo a̱ na̱shi. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />A̱vu Ga'al ulobo wa Ebe u 'ya̱wa̱ wi isawan o u'uwata wu una̱ntsu u lyuci'i, reve gba Abimele oɓolo na aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i uvawun a̱tsuma̱ o ogozo o uta̱ pe.<verse eid="JDG 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Ana Ga'al enei ama'a, reve u damma Zebu, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, ama a ɗa ndeɗe a̱ cipusa̱ zuva masasan!&gt;&gt; A̱vu Zebu damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ta tarasa lulu vu nsasan tsa ama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />A̱vu Ga'al yuwisan adanshi u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i ama a̱ ta̱ ɗe a̱ cipusa̱ e memere me iɗa, waru oɓolo a̱ ta̱ ɗe a̱ ta̱wusa̱ diga upasu wu uɗanga wo Oku wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Reve Zebu damma yi, &lt;&lt;Gogo te ɗa gba ushitosun wu una̱ wa̱ wu, za na vu dammai, &lt;Zane ɗa gba Abimele, ana tsaa yuwaan yi tsugbashi?&gt; Ele ɗa ama a na vu tarai ili'i shi shi? Uta̱ vu yuwan nla̱ngi ne ele!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Reve Ga'al uwaa azagbain a Shekem elime, a̱vu a yuwan uvon na̱ Abimele. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />A̱vu Abimele saɓa yi, a̱vu gba u suma, a̱vu a amaton ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱vu a̱ riya̱, hali a̱ tyo o u'uwata wu una̱ntsu'u. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />A̱vu Abimele da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a Aruma, a̱vu Zebu gba̱ra̱ Ga'al na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi o uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Shekem.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Ana usana u tawai, ɗaɗa ama a Shekem a̱ ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo a atsusa, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ Abimele aɗa. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />A̱vu u tara ali o uvon a̱ yi, a̱vu u ne'eshen le oɓolo a ta'atsu, a̱vu u zuwa le a vawan a̱tsuma̱ a atsusa. Ana we enei ama o utusa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i, a̱vu Abimele uta̱ tsa̱ra̱ wu una le. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />A̱vu Abimele no oɓolo a ama a̱ yi a̱ utushi, a̱vu gba e geshe u'uwata wu una̱ntsu u lyuci'i. A̱vu oɓolo e re a na a buwai o utushi a̱ riya̱a̱ ama'a nu uvon a̱tsuma̱ a atsusa'a, a̱vu o una nle. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />A̱vu Abimele liva̱ a yuwusan uvon na̱ lyuci'i. Reve u usa lyuci'i, a̱vu wu una ama a̱ yi. Reve a̱ rukutsa̱ lyuci'i, a̱vu u kusha'wa yi akpaɗi.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Ana azagbain a atsura a Shekem suru a uwwai ne, a uwa ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wu ucira wa̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ wa El Beri. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Ana Abimele uwwai a na o ɓoloto ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u ta̱, <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ zuva masasan ma̱ Zalumo oɓolo na ama a̱ yi suru. A̱vu Abimele tara aɓau, a̱vu wu koɗo eten a̱vu u sheɗe le u zuwa le a avangaci a̱ yi. A̱vu u damma ama a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Ili i na ye ene numu a yuwusan, i jika̱ i yuwan yi fo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />A̱vu ama'a o koɗo eten ɗaɗa o toniyi Abimele, a̱vu o ɓoloto ete'en uba̱ta̱ wu ucira'a, reve a adaɓa yi akina za̱la̱ le. Ama a na o ɓolotoi uba̱ta̱ wu ukari wa Shekem'm, a ta yuwan ama ukpakukupa (1,000), ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱vu a̱ kuwa̱.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />A̱vu Abimele ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Tebe a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ yi reve gba u usa yi. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Amma uba̱ta̱ wu ucira u ro u da̱na̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i, a̱vu ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci suru na azagbain a̱ lyuci'i suru a suma a̱ tyo ɗe, reve a katsu pe aciyele. A̱vu a kumba a̱ tyo o ukwa̱'a̱ wa atsura'a. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />A̱vu Abimele ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa atsura'a tsa̱ra̱ u yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi, reve u rawa zuzu nu u'uwata wa atsura'a adama u kula̱to yi na akina. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />A̱vu ka ro vara Abimele na aakiri a yira a aaci, a̱vu mokkoto ma aaci ma̱ yi mo ɓoso.<verse eid="JDG 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />A̱vu Abimele ɗeshi ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu tala matsun me pe'eni ma̱ wu a̱vu vu una mu, adama a̱ ta̱wa̱ a damma &lt;Ka ɗa vu una numu wan.&gt; &gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa gba ulobo'o u sapai Abimele, reve u kuwa̱. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Ana ama a Isra'ila suru e enei Abimele ukwa̱ ta̱, reve suru nle a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Tsundolo tsa ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱yi Abimele ni iwuya i na u yuwayin dada va̱ yi, a na wu unai a̱za̱ a̱ yi ali kupocindere. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Tsundolo tsa ɗa waru A̱sula̱ a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱yi ama a Shekem ni iwuya i le. Una̱ u na Jotam ulobo wa Jeru Ba'al u yuwaan nle u reme le ta̱.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Ana Abimele kuwa̱i, Tola ulobo wa Puwa, ulobo wo Dodo za vu ugundo wa Isaka, 'yon ta̱ adama u wawa aza a Isra'ila. U da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Shami o upasu wi iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />U yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila a'wan ushin na aza a ta'atsu. Reve u kuwa̱ ɗaɗa a̱ ciɗo niyi a̱tsuma̱ a Shami.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jayi wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ yi a̱vu Jayi vuma va Giliyadu 'yon, a̱yi fo u yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila a'wan ushin ne ejere. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />U da̱na̱ ta̱ no olobo mata'atsu aza a na a kumbusa nloli mata'atsu. A yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsi ilyuci mata'atsu a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Giliyadu, aza a na hali na ana'an a̱ tsu ɗe Havot Jayi. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Ana Jayi kuwa̱i, ɗaɗa a̱ ciɗo niyi a̱tsuma̱ a Kamon.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Japuta wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwisan ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, reve a yuwaan a̱ma̱li Ba'al na̱ Ashitore a̱ga̱nda̱, na̱ musula̱ ma Suriya na̱ musula̱ ma Sidon na̱ musula̱ ma Mowa na̱ musula̱ ma aza a Amon, oɓolo na̱ musula̱ ma aza a Filistiya. Ne ɗa aza a Isra'ila a variyi A̱sulazuva waru a buwa a yuwusaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ shi. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Reve gba A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan ne ele lon. Ɗaɗa u zuwa nle e ekere a aza a Filistiya ne ekere aza a Amon. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Reve e irima waru o ɓongi aza a Isra'ila a aa'wan o ndolo. O ɓongi ta̱ aza a Isra'ila hali a'wan kupa na̱ kunla̱ upasu wa asana wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱tsuma̱ a Giliyadu, iɗa ya aza a Amoriya. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />A̱vu aza a Amon a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu tsa̱ra̱ a yuwan uvon nu ugundo wa Yahuza na̱ Banyami na̱ Ifiramu. Aza a Isra'ila a̱ shi ta̱ a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a addama lon. <verse eid="JDG 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Reve aza a Isra'ila e showen A̱sulazuva a dansa, &lt;&lt;Tsu yuwaan wu ta̱ unusu, adama a na tsu lyawai A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu reve tsu yuwaan a̱ma̱li Ba'al a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11-12" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma aza a Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Ashe n wawa ɗu e ekere a aza a Masar na aza a Amoriya na aza a Amon, waru na aza a Filistiya, na aza a Sidon na aza a Amaleka na aza a Mawon, a mantsa ma na o ɓongi nɗu, ana i showen mu shi? <verse eid="JDG 10:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Na̱ ne suru i vari mu ta̱ a̱vu i yuwaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱, adama o ndolo m buwa a wawa ɗu shi. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />'Ya̱wa̱i i showen musula̱ n na i ɗangwai, lyawa le a wawa ɗu a mantsa ma na i ri a addama!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a damma A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;Tsu yuwan ta̱ unusu, yuwan na̱ tsu ili i na ve enei u lobono ta̱. Amma ili i ta̱ i ɗa vaa yuwaan tsu vu wawa tsu ana'an.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Ɗaɗa o ocoi musula̱ mo omocin n na n ri a̱tsuma̱ e le, reve a yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱. Ɗaɗa gba a̱tsuma̱ a̱ la̱nga̱ niyi adama a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na aza a Isra'ila oo sowuso.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />A̱vu aza a Amon o ɓoloto ali o uvon e le uba̱ta̱ u ta̱, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Giliyadu. A̱vu aza a Isra'ila gba o ɓoloto uba̱ta̱ u ta̱, reve a̱ va̱la̱ Mizfa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Reve azagbain a aza a Giliyadu a dammulai, &lt;&lt;Za na suru fara 'ya̱wa̱yi ama a Amon nu uvon, a̱yi ɗa woo o'wo zagbain tsu ama a Giliyadu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s">Japuta wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Japuta za va Giliyadu vuma gbain ɗa na gurai uvon. Giliyadu ɗa dada va̱ yi, amma mma va̱ yi aashakala a ɗa. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Ka va Giliyadu gba u matsaan yi ta̱ olobo, reve ana muwun mu ka'a n kungwai, a̱vu a̱ gba̱ra̱ Japuta, a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Va̱a̱ tsura̱ ko agadu e ili i ta̱ ya dada tsu shi, adama a na a̱vu mawun ma ka ro ma ɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Reve Japuta suma diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi, reve u 'ya̱wa̱ u da̱nu e iɗa ya Tob, uba̱ta̱ u na iɓolo ya ama a vama o ɓolotoi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, reve a̱ kurusu yi o uta̱.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Urana u ro, reve aza a Amon a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ aza a Isra'ila nu uvon. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Reve ana aza a Amon a̱ 'ya̱wa̱yi aza a a Isra'ila nu uvon, reve mbara ma Giliyadu n 'ya̱wa̱ adama a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ Japuta diga e iɗa ya Tob. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Reve a damma Japuta, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ vu wala tsu elime tsura̱ tsu yuwan uvon na aza a Amon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />A̱vu Japuta damma le, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ɗa i 'yuwan numu shi, a̱vu i gba̱ra̱ mu o u'wa wa dada va̱ shi? Nye i zuwai i ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ va̱ gogo, ana i riya̱i a̱tsuma̱ a addama ko?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Reve mbara'a n damma Japuta, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa i zuwai tsu ka̱mba̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu gogo. Tsu ka̱mba̱ ta̱ ya̱'a̱ wu tsa̱ra̱ vu kuru tsu a̱ ka̱mba̱, vu yuwan uvon na aza a Amon, a̱vu ɗa voo o'wo zagbain tsu, waru na aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden e iɗa ya Giliyadu suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />A̱vu Japuta usu, &lt;&lt;Hali ni i ka̱mbuwa̱ mu n yuwan uvon na aza a Amon, na̱ A̱sulazuva a ca mu n lyuwa aci e le, n to o'wo zagbain ɗu mayun?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />A̱vu mbara'a a̱ usu, yi &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ e inda tsu, tsu ta̱ gba a yuwan cine vu dammai na amayun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Ɗaɗa Japuta toniyi mbara ma Giliyadu'u a̱ ka̱ra̱, reve ama'a a zuwa yi zagbain le na̱ yali ya̱ a̱soja e le. Japuta gba u dammisa ta̱ suru ili i na u dammai a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a Mizfa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Reve Japuta lyungu nlingata uba̱ta̱ u mogono ma aza a Amon na̱ yeci, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i ɓolo numu na̱ a̱vu, i na i zuwai vu ta̱wa̱a̱ numu nu uvon e iɗa i va̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Mogono ma aza a Amon ma̱ usu ta̱ nlingata ma Japuta u damma, &lt;&lt;Ana aza a Isra'ila o uta̱i diga e iɗa ya Masar, a usa mu ta̱ iɗa diga o Uɗolu wa Anon a̱ tyo o Uɗolu wa Jabo, hali a̱ tyo o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu. Gogo she vu ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ mu iɗa i va̱ na̱ asuvu nden.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Japuta lyunguwisa̱ ta̱ nlingata a̱ ka̱mbisa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono ma aza a Amon, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Nda ili i na Japuta dammai: aza a Isra'ila a usa iɗa ya̱ Mowa ko iɗa ya aza a Amon shi. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Amma a na o uta̱i diga e iɗa ya Masar, aza a Isra'ila a̱ kuru ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱tsumona a̱ tyo a Mala ma̱ Shili a̱vu a rawa Kedesh. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mkc 20:14-21</char></note>Aza a Isra'ila a̱ lyungu ta̱ nlingata uba̱ta̱ u mogono ma Edom, a damma, &lt;Ne'e tsu ure tsu kuru ni iɗa ya̱ wu,&gt; agba mogono ma Edom mo polo atsuvu shi. Reve waru a̱ lyungu nlingata uba̱ta̱ u mogono ma̱ Mowa, a̱vu u 'yuwan. Ɗaɗa aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱nuyi Kedesh.<verse eid="JDG 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />&lt;&lt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mkc 21:4</char></note>Ɗaɗa a lyuwai elime na̱ mmalu a̱tsumona, reve a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ iɗa ya Edom na̱ Mowa, a̱ kuru asana ni iɗa ya̱ Mowa, reve a̱ va̱la̱ upasu u ro wa Anon. A uwa upasu wi iɗa ya̱ Mowa shi, adama a na Anon ɗa utyo wa̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />&lt;&lt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:19-22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mkc 21:21-24; U. Wl 2:26-37.</char></note>Reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ lyungu nlingata uba̱ta̱ u mogono Sihon va aza a Amoriya, za tsugono tsa Heshibon, a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;Lyawa tsu tsu ka̱ra̱la̱i e iɗa ya̱ wu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u tsu.&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Agba u ɓatsaa Sihon okolo aza a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱ra̱la̱i ni iɗa ya̱ yi shi. Reve u ɓoloto ama a̱ yi suru uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ reve a̱ va̱la̱ Jaha, a̱vu a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="JDG 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila, a zuwa Sihon na ama a̱ yi e ekere a aza a Isra'ila, a̱vu a lyuwa le nu uvon. Reve ama a Isra'ila a usa iɗa ya aza a Amoriya suru aza a na a̱ ri nden e iɗa'a. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Reve a usa iɗa ya aza a Amoriya suru diga o Uɗolu wa Anon hali a rawa o Uɗolu wa Jabo, na̱ diga a̱tsumona a̱ tyo o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu.<verse eid="JDG 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Gogo ana A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a ɗa a̱ gba̱ra̱i aza a Amoriya diga e iɗa'a adama a ama a̱ yi aza a Isra'ila, gogo vu ciga ta̱ vu usa yi? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Vaa tara ili i na Kemosh ma̱sula̱ ma̱ wu ma ca nuwu shi? Ne ɗa a̱tsu fo ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ca ntsu ɗa tsaa tara. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mkc 22:1-6</char></note>Gogo la'a ta̱ Balak ulobo wa Zipo, Mogono ma̱ Mowa ɗa? U uwa ta̱ mawasan na ama a Isra'ila, ko vu uwwa ta̱ u yuwan ta̱ uvon ne ele ɗa? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />A̱yi ɗa nda a'wan ukpakuta'atsu (300) ana aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱nuyi Heshibon, na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi, na̱ Arowa na̱ mulyuci n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi, na̱ suru ilyuci i na i ri zuzu na̱ Anon. Nye i zuwai vu usa nle diga mantsa mo ndolo'o shi? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />A̱mu n yuwaan wu unusu shi, amma a̱vu ɗa nda vu yuwaan mu ta̱ iwuya uba̱ta̱ o uvon u na vaa yuwusan na̱ a̱mu. Lyawa A̱sulazuva za na a̱yi ɗa za vu uge'etosu u paɗa ugana ana'an e ekere a aza a Isra'ila na aza a Amon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Agba mogono ma aza a Amon mo polo atsuvu e ikaka i na Japuta lyunguwa̱ niyi shi.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Reve Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva cipa̱a̱ Japuta. A̱vu Japuta 'yon u kuru upasu wa Giliyadu na̱ Manase, reve u pasalai Mizfa va Giliyadu, diga ɗe a̱vu u pasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Amon. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Reve Japuta yuwan akucunu a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, u damma, &lt;&lt;Na̱ vu ca aza a Amon e ekere a̱ va̱ na amayun, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />ili i na i fara uta̱i o ukobu wu u'wa u va̱ adama u ga'aton mu mantsa ma na n ka̱mba̱i nu ulyuwu wa aci diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon na aza Amon, u to o'wo za va̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve n ca yi wo o'wo kucci vu ukula̱tosu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Reve Japuta pasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Amon adama u yuwan uvon ne ele, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a ca yi ele e ekere a̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Reve u kototo ilyuci ushin diga Arowa a̱ tyo upasu wa̱ Mini hali a rawa Habila Keramin u kototo le ta̱ wa'a shi. Ne ɗa Isra'ila lyuwai aci a Amon.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Ana Japuta ka̱mba̱i o u'wa wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a Mizfa, ɗaɗa usheli wa̱ yi wu uta̱i adama u raba yi, o uje'en na̱ tsuwa'i. A̱yi ɗa yi mawun goon u ri nu ulobo ko usheli u ro shi. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Ana we ene niyi, reve wu kara a̱tugu a̱ yi a̱vu u saala, &lt;&lt;O! Usheli u va̱! Vo o'wo mu ta̱ ili ya̱ a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu lon, vu ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ta̱ na addama, adama a na n yuwan ta̱ akucunu e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva agba waa yuwan n ka̱mba̱ na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Dada va̱, vu yuwan ta̱ akucunu e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. Yuwan na̱ a̱mu cine vu yuwain nzuwulai, hali a na wo o'woi A̱sulazuva a tsupaa nuwu e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ wu, aza a Amon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />A̱vu u damma dada va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Lyawa vu yuwaan mu ili i nda na̱ vu usu. Vu ca mu woto re n 'ya̱wa̱ a agaɗi oɓolo na̱ n'utsa̱ n va̱, adama n yuwan mesun ma̱ tsusheli tsa̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱.&gt;&gt; A̱vu u lyawa yi u ka̱ra̱ hali woto re'e, a̱yi na̱ n'utsa̱ ma̱ yi reve a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a agaɗi, a̱vu a yuwan a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu adama a na waa yuwan lolo shi. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Ana o kotoi woto re, reve u ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa dada va̱ yi. Reve dada'a u ca yi o una̱ wa akucunu a na u yuwain e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱yi gba koto u shi u reve vali shi. Reve wo o'wo agadu a aza a Isra'ila, <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />a na muwun me esheli ma Isra'ila n tsu uta̱ rana na̱shi a aa'wan suru adama o roco a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu e le adama a cuwan nu usheli wa Japuta vuma va Giliyadu.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Japuta yuwan ta̱ uvon na ama a Ifiramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Ama a Ifiramu o ɓoloto ta̱ ali o uvon e le uba̱ta̱ u ta̱. A̱vu a pasa a̱ tyo Zafon, a̱vu a damma Japuta, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye vu 'ya̱wa̱i vu yuwain uvon na aza a Amon agba vu banu tsu shi? To, tsu ta̱ kula̱to wu oɓolo nu u'wa wa̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Ɗaɗa Japuta damma nle, &lt;&lt;A̱mu oɓolo na ama a̱ va̱ tsu tsura̱ ta̱ mawasan ma̱ a̱bunda̱ na aza a Amon, waru ana n ɗe nɗu, i ta̱wa̱ i wawa mu e ekere e le shi. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Ana waru me enei yaa wawa mu shi, ɗaɗa n cayi wuma u va̱ reve m pasa adama n 'ya̱wa̱ n yuwan uvon na aza a Amon, a̱vu gba A̱sulazuva a ca mu ele e ekere a̱ va̱. Gogo adama a̱ nye a ɗa i pasai ana'an a̱ ta̱wa̱ adama i yuwan uvon na̱ a̱mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />A̱vu Japuta ɓoloto ali a Giliyadu suru, reve a yuwan uvon na aza a Ifiramu. Ɗaɗa gba ali a Giliyadu o kototoi Ifiramu, adama a na a dammai, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu a̱za̱ a Giliyadu aza e izami yu upa'atan u ɗa e memere ma Ifiramu na aza a Manase.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />A̱vu aza a Giliyadu a usa upasata o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱ tyo Ifiramu. Mantsa ma na vuma va Ifiramu ro na la'ai dammai, &lt;&lt;Lyawa m pasa,&gt;&gt; reve aza a Giliyadu e ece yi, &lt;&lt;A̱vu za va Ifiramu ɗa?&gt;&gt; Nu u usu, &lt;&lt;O'o,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;To damma &lt;Shibole.&gt; &gt;&gt; Nu u damma &lt;&lt;Sibole,&gt;&gt; adama a na waa gura ɗe adanshi'i ulobonu shi, a̱vu e reme yi o una yi o upasata wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu. A mantsa mo ndolo ma ɗa o unai ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa ure (42,000) wa aza a Ifiramu.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Japuta yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila a'wan a̱ ta̱li. Ɗaɗa Japuta za va Giliyadu kuwa̱i, reve a̱ ciɗo yi a̱ lyuci ro va̱ Giliyadu.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibuzan na̱ Elon na̱ Abudon a wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />A̱ca̱pa̱ a Japuta, Ibuzan za va Batalami yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />U da̱na̱ ta̱ no olobo mata'atsu, esheli mata'atsu. A̱vu u ca esheli a̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a̱ ri o umatsun wa̱ yi shi lolo. A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ ne esheli mata'atsu aza a na a̱ ri o umatsun wa̱ yi shi adama o olobo a̱ yi. Ibuzan yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila a'wan e cindere. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />A̱vu Ibuzan kuwa̱ a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi Batalami.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ Ibuzan, reve Elon vuma va Zebulun yuwan tsugbain tsa Isra'ila a'wan kupa. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Reve Elon kuwa̱, ɗaɗa a̱ ciɗo niyi ɗe Ajalo e iɗa ya Zebulun.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ yi, a̱vu Abudon ulobo wa Hilele, vuma va Piraton, yuwan tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />U da̱na̱ ta̱ no olobo amunga na̱ muwun n tsukaya mata'atsu, aza a na a kumbusai o nloli kupocindere. U yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila a'wan kunla̱. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Reve Abudon ulobo wa Hilele vuma va Piraton kuwa̱, reve a̱ ciɗo yi ɗe Piraton e iɗa ya̱ Ifiramu e iɗa ya agaɗi ya aza a Amaleka.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Limatan va Samuson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwisan ili i iwuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a ca le e ekere a aza a Filistiya hali a'wan amunga.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Vuma ro da̱na̱ ta̱ lo za na a̱ tsu ɗe Manowa a̱ lyuci va̱ Zora. Diga o ugundo wa Dan, ka va̱ yi idari i ɗa i shi waru koto u shi u tsura̱ limatan shi. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wu ka'a a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ko na vu ri idari waru koto vu tsura̱i limatan shi, vu ta̱ tsura̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ reve vu matsan ulobo. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Gogo vu ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu, she vu sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi wan, ko ili i na yaa zuwa wu vo o'wo usowu ko ke'en wan, ko vu lyuwa ili i na i ri idaba wan. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Adama a na vu ta yuwan a̱tsuma̱ reve vu matsan ulobo. She a̱ ju'wa̱n aaci a̱ yi nu utanu wan, adama a na ulobo'o u to o'wo za na a tawai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkc 6:1-21</char></note> adama a̱ A̱sula̱ diga a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱. U teme mawawa ma aza a Isra'ila e ekere a aza a Filistiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Reve ka'a u 'ya̱wa̱ u damma vali va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱. U rotso ta̱ malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱, u ta̱ wovon. Me ece yi uba̱ta̱ u na wu uta̱i shi, agba waru u damma aala a̱ yi shi. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Amma u damma mu ta̱, &lt;Vu ta yuwan a̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱vu vu matsan mawun mo ulobo. Adama o ndolo, she vu sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi wan, ko ili i na ya zuwa wu vo o'wo usowu wan, waru she vu lyuwa ili yi idaba wan, adama a na mawu'un u to o'wo za na a tawai a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ diga a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tyo a mantsa mo ukwa̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />A̱vu Manowa yuwan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva u damma:&lt;&lt;Zagbain m pati wu ta̱, lyawa vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ za na vu lyunguyi a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u tsu u ta̱wa̱ u rito tsu cine tsaa kungwato mawun ma na aa matsaan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />A̱vu A̱sula̱ a uwwa avasa a Manowa, reve malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma̱ ta̱wisa̱ uba̱ta̱ wu ka'a a̱yi lo nden a atsusa. Agba Manowa vali va̱ yi da̱na̱ lo oɓolo na̱ a̱yi shi. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />A̱vu ka'a u suma u jika̱ a̱vu u damma vali va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Apa nda vuma na ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ u va̱ urana u lo'o, u ta̱wisa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />A̱vu Manowa 'yon a̱vu u toni ka va̱ yi. Ana u ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ u vuma'a, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗaɗa vuma na yuwain adanshi na̱ ka va̱'a̱?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗaɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Ɗaɗa Manowa aa damma, &lt;&lt;Na adanshi a̱ wu a̱ ta̱wa̱ a shiwan, cine tsa ɗa tsaa kungwato mawu'un, nye waru waa yuwan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma damma Manowa, &lt;&lt;Ili i na n dammai ka'a lyawa u kuru le suru. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />She u lyuwa ili i na a yuwain nu umatsun wa ataci, ko u sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ko ili i na yaa zuwa yi wo o'wo usowu, ko u lyuwa ili yi idaba wan. U toni ili i na n damma niyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Ɗaɗa Manowa dammai malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva'a, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri she vu ka̱ra̱ ne'e wan lyawa tsu paɗaa wu meggbele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma damma Manowa, &lt;&lt;Ko shi vu geshe mu pa, maa lyuwa ilyalya ya̱ wu shi. Amma na̱ vu foɓo kucci vu ukula̱tosu, to a̱vu vu ca A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt; Adama a na Manowa gura reve a na malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma ɗa shi.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Reve Manowa ece malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva'a, &lt;&lt;Cine tsa ɗa aala a̱ wu, adama na adanshi a̱ wu a shiwan tsu cuwa wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma damma yi, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye ve ece numu aala a̱ va̱? U la'a ta̱ ucira u na vee reve.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Reve Manowa tara meggbele na̱ kucci vi ishina, reve u ca A̱sulazuva kucci a aatali. Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan a̱ba̱jini e ili ya asalama, Manowa na̱ ka va̱ yi a̱ka̱nla̱. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Reve ana elentsu a akina a̱ 'yoyin a̱ tyo zuva diga a masa'a, a̱vu malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva'a mo toni elentsu a akina'a. Ana e enei ne Manowa na̱ ka va̱ yi a̱ riya̱ ta̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Ana malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva mo rocoyi aciya̱yi waru shi ya Manowa na̱ ka va̱ yi, Manowa gura ta̱ reve a na malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma ɗa ma̱ da̱na̱i.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />A̱vu Manowa damma ka va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Na amayun tsu ta̱ kuwa̱, adama a na tse enei A̱sula̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Agba ka va̱ yi usu yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Na̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ shi a ciga wu una tsu, u shi a̱ usu kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ za vi ishina e ekere a̱ tsu shi, ko u roco tsu ili i nda ko u ka̱mbuwa̱ tsu ili i nda suru shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />A̱vu ka'a u matsan ulobo, reve u ɗe yi Samuson. Reve u kungwa a̱vu A̱sulazuva a zuwaa yi aba'un. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Reve Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva e teme a yuwusan ulinga na̱ a̱yi, a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a Mahane Dan, e memere ma̱ Zora na̱ Eshitawo.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Lolo va Samuson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Urana u ro Samuson 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ Timna, reve we ene ɗe usheli wa aza a Filistiya. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Ana u ka̱mba̱i o u'wa reve u ka̱mbuwa̱ dada va̱ yi na̱ mma va̱ yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ usheli wa aza a Filistiya ɗe Timna, n ciga ta̱ i taraa mu a̱yi wo o'wo ka va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Amma dada va̱ yi na̱ mma va̱ yi a damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Babu usheli a̱tsuma̱ e imaci ya̱ wu, ko a̱tsuma̱ a ama a̱ tsu suru? Cine tsa ɗa she na̱ vu 'ya̱wa̱ vu zami ka a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na koto a paɗai uryumbu shi, aza a Filistiya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Amma Samuson damma ta̱ dada va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Taraa numu a̱yi. A̱yi ɗa za na uwa numu o okolo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Dada va̱ yi oɓolo na̱ mma va̱ yi e reve a na ifoɓi ya̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa shi, adama a na u ta zama ure u na waa yuwan uvon na aza a Filistiya, adama a na a mantsa mo ndolo ele ɗa aa yuwusain tsugbain tsa ama a Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Ɗaɗa Samuson na̱ dada va̱ yi oɓolo na̱ mma va̱ yi a̱ ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo Timna. Ana a rawai a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a ina̱bi a Timna, a̱vu makamu ma̱ zura̱ yi a̱ ma̱gugwa̱. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />A̱vu Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ cipa̱a̱ yi nu ucira, a̱vu u karalai kamu'u ne ekere cine vuma aa karalai meggbele. Agba u damma dada ko mma va̱ yi ili i na u yuwain shi. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Reve u 'ya̱wa̱ u yuwan adanshi na̱ ka'a, reve gba u uwa o okolo a Samuson a̱bunda̱ lon.<verse eid="JDG 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Ana a tarai mamantsa, a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ adama u zuwa yi, reve u ɓatsa adama we ene lipu vu kamu na wu unai. A̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi a̱vu we ene pe ishiki na abaji e ishiki. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Reve u kene ne ekere a̱ yi, a̱vu reme e peɗishe a̱yi a mmalu. Ana u cinai nan dada va̱ yi, a̱vu u ne'e le fo, a̱vu ele fo e peɗe. Agba u damma le a na u kenei ishiki'i a̱ a̱a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a̱ lipu vu kamu shi.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />A̱vu dada va̱ yi 'ya̱wa̱ we ene usheli'i. Ɗaɗa Samuson foɓoi a̱buki ɗe, ne ɗa muwun mo olobo n tsu yuwusan. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Ana aza a Filistiya e ene niyi, ɗaɗa a ɗangulai olobo mata'atsu a̱ da̱nu oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="JDG 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Reve Samuson damma le, &lt;&lt;Lyawa n yuwaan ɗu cu'un yitele iro. Ni i gura damma mu ko nye i ɗa, a̱tsuma̱ a rana cindere va̱ a̱buki'i, n ta ca ɗu amuna o okoro mata'atsu ni itana yu otosu i ro ko'o mata'atsu. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Amma gba ni i gura damma mu shi, to, i ta ca mu amuna o okoro mata'atsu ni itana yu otosu ko'o mata'atsu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Damma tsu cu'un yitele ya̱ wu, tsa̱ra̱ tsu uwwa yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a liwi, ili i malya yu uta̱i. A̱tsuma̱ a za vu ucira ili ya̱ a̱limu yu uta̱i.&gt;&gt; Agba a̱tsuma̱ a rana ta'atsu a gura ca ucuɗuwu u yitele i ndolo shi.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />O urana wa̱ na̱shi ɗaɗa a dammai ka va Samuson, &lt;&lt;Vu kpara vali va̱ wu u damma tsu ucuɗuwu u yitele i ndolo, na̱ ne ɗa shi tsu ta̱ kula̱to wu oɓolo nu u'wa wa dada va̱ wu. I banu tsu ta̱ pa a̱buki a nda adama i yuwan tsu a'usa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />A̱vu ka va Samuson vowon yi e shoshen yi a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱vu de vu 'yuwan mu ta̱! Vu ciga mu na amayun shi. Vu yuwaan ta̱ ama a̱ tsu cu'un yitele i ro, agba vu damma mu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi shi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Ɗaɗa u damma niyi, &lt;&lt;Amayun koto n cuɗuwa dada ko mma va̱ shi. Cine tsa ɗa maa cuɗuwa wu a̱yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana cindere va̱ a̱buki o ndolo, a̱vu u da̱na̱ e mesun a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi, ɗaɗa o urana we cindere u damma niyi, adama a na u damaton niyi a̱bunda̱ lon. Ɗaɗa gba u 'ya̱wa̱i u dammai ama a̱ yi ucuɗuwu u yitele'e.<verse eid="JDG 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Kafu urana u koto o urana we cindere'e, ɗaɗa ama a̱ lyuci'i a damma niyi, &lt;&lt;Ili i ne i ɗa i la'ai ishiki a̱limu? Waru ili i ne i ɗa i la'ai kamu ucira?&gt;&gt; Reve Samuson damma le, &lt;&lt;Ni i shi i yuwan iluma na̱ a̱na̱wun a nan va̱ shi, i shi a gura tsura̱ ucuɗuwu wu cu'un yitele i va̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />A̱vu Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ cipa̱a̱ yi nu ucira, ɗaɗa u 'ya̱wa̱i Ashikelon uba̱ta̱ u na wu unai ama mata'atsu, a̱vu u pura̱ a̱tugu e le a̱vu u ca aza a na a damma niyi ucuɗuwu u yitele'e. Nu upan wa̱ a̱bunda̱ a ɗa u ka̱mba̱i o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />A̱vu a tara ka va Samuson, ɗaɗa a cayi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o olobo a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi'i za na shi i'utsa̱ i lolo va̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s">Samuson tsupa ta̱ e ekere a aza a Filistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Ana a yuwain rana meketeci, a mantsa me ikani i yitabo, Samuson 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ adama u ca̱sa̱ ka va̱ yi a̱vu u tara meggbele. Reve u damma dada vu ka va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;N ta uwa maa asa na̱ ka va̱.&gt;&gt; Agba dada va̱ yi lyawa yi u uwa pe shi.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />A̱vu dada vu usheli'i u damma, &lt;&lt;N ta yuwusan majiyan vu 'yuwan yi ta̱ suru suru, adama o ndolo n ca ta̱ ɗe za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱vu. Zawa'a va̱ yi la'a yi ulobonu lon shi? Vu zuwa yi o una̱ wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Ɗaɗa Samuson tsu damma, &lt;&lt;Gogo ma̱a̱ da̱na̱ nu unusu o ulungusu u na maa yuwaan aza a Filistiya shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Reve Samuson reme musa̱n mu una ukpakuta'atsu (300), a̱vu wu nla̱ le wizan na̱ wizan ejere re. A̱vu u zuwa akata a akina e memere me ezan e re suru. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Ana u daɓai akata'a akina, a̱vu u lyawa musa̱n mu una'a a̱tsuma̱ e ishina i mishin ya aza a Filistiya. Reve a̱ kula̱to akatalu ni ishina i mishin, oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ zetun.<verse eid="JDG 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />A̱vu aza a Filistiya a damma, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa yuwan ntsu ulinga u nda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:6">A̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Samuson ɗa, toto vuma va Timna, adama a na dada vu ka va Samuson u tara ta̱ ka va̱ yi a̱vu u ca i'utsa̱ i lolo va̱ yi.&gt;&gt; Reve aza a Filistiya a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ kula̱to ka'a oɓolo na̱ dada va̱ yi hali a̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Reve Samuson damma le, &lt;&lt;Na̱ tsunda tsa ɗa i yuwaan numu, n kucina ta̱ maa bula̱ shi she na̱ n tsupa e ekere a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Reve gba Samuson ga̱la̱ le uga̱lu, wu una le na̱ a̱bunda̱. Reve u zura̱ a̱ cipa̱ u 'ya̱wa̱ u da̱nu a̱ a̱a̱ba̱nu a aatali a Etam.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Reve aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ va̱la̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda, reve a baza hali a rawa Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Reve aza a Yahuda a damma le, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai i ta̱wa̱i adama i yuwan uvon na̱ a̱tsu?&gt;&gt; Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsu reme Samuson, a̱vu tsu yuwaan yi cine u yuwaan ntsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />A̱vu ama a Yahuda ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) a̱ zura̱ a̱ cipa̱ a̱ a̱a̱ba̱nu a aatali a Etam, reve a damma Samuson, &lt;&lt;Vu reve a na aza a Filistiya a ɗa a̱ ri nu ucira a aci a̱ tsu shi? Cine vu yuwan ntsu tsunda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">A̱vu u usu le, &lt;&lt;Cine a yuwan numu, ne ɗa n yuwaan nle.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Tsu zura̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ adama tsu nla̱ wu, a̱vu tsu ca aza a Filistiya a̱vu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Reve Samuson damma le, &lt;&lt;Kucinaa numu a na a̱ɗu na aciya̱ɗu a ɗa yoo una mu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />A̱vu a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;O'o, wunlu u ɗa goon tsa̱a̱ nla̱ wu a̱vu tsu ca aza a Filistiya. Na amayun tsoo una wu shi.&gt;&gt; A̱vu a̱ nla̱ yi na amunga a sa'avu e re a̱vu o uta̱a̱ yi a gawan diga a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ba̱nu'u. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Ana u ta̱wa̱i Lehi, aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a yisaali adama a ga'an na̱ a̱yi. Reve Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva cipa̱a̱ yi nu ucira. Reve amunga a na a̱ nla̱yi e ekere a̱ yi a kasa gashi agaruma a na a̱ kula̱toi na akina, a̱vu ili i na a̱ nla̱ niyi o oco e iɗa. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />A̱vu u tsura̱ eetele a sa'avu o ugbaguzu u mololi, a̱vu u tara yi, a̱vu wu una ali ukpakukupa (1,000) na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="JDG 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />A̱vu Samuson damma, &lt;&lt;Ne eetele o ugbaguzu u mololi u ɗa mu unai oɓolo zuva vo oɓolo, waru ne eetele o ugbaguzu u mololi u ɗa mu unai oɓolo a ali ukpakukupa (1,000.)&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />A̱yi o mokotoo ma adanshi, ɗaɗa u variyi eetele o ugbaguzu u mololi'i, ɗaɗa gba a cayi uba̱ta̱'a̱ aala Ramata Lehi, a na aagaɗi e eetele o Ugbaguzu u Mololi.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Waru adama a na wu uwwai akuli a̱bunda̱, reve u pati A̱sulazuva u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu ca ta̱ aagbashi a̱ wu ulyuwu wa aci a gbain a nda. Gogo gba vu ciga mu ta̱ n kuwa̱ na akuli, reve n riya̱ e ekere a aza Filistiya a na koto a paɗai uryumbu shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />A̱vu A̱sula̱ a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri o ro e iɗa ya Lehi, a̱vu mini mo uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi. Ana Samuson sowoi mini'i, a̱vu ugbozu wa̱ yi u ka̱mba̱ reve u garatsuwa. Adama o ndolo a ɗa a cayi uba̱ta̱'a̱ aala En Hakori, a na lyusu mini vu za vu ɗesu, waru u ta̱ ɗe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lehi hali na ana'an.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samuson yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila a'wan ushin a rana na aza a Filistiya a̱ da̱na̱i nu ucira a aci e le.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samuson na̱ Dalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Urana u ro Samuson 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱ lyuci va Gaza va aza a Filistiya, ɗe ɗa we enei aashakala o ro, a̱vu u uwa waa asa na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />A damma ta̱ ama a Gaza, &lt;&lt;Samuson ta̱ pa!&gt;&gt; A̱vu a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ uba̱ta̱'a̱ a vawan yi ayin ma̱ɓula̱ o u'uwata u lyuci'i. A yuwan elemu shi na ayin o ndolo, adansa, &lt;&lt;Nu usana u tawa reve tsu una yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Agba a̱vu Samuson von hali ayin uɓatsulai lon. A̱vu u 'yon a̱vu u reme una̱ntsu wu u'uwata u lyuci'i, na akpata a̱ nge'en e re, a̱vu wu mula̱ le oɓolo na̱ rumu, a̱vu u tanu le a̱ nlyungu ma̱ yi, ɗaɗa u tara nle a̱ tyo a aagaɗi a na a̱ ri nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Heburon.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi, a̱vu Samuson ciga usheli u na a̱ tsu ɗe Dalila, za na ri na̱ nden o Uka̱ri wa̱ Sore. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Reve azagbain a aza a Filistiya a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ya Dalila reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu kpara Samuson u damma wu uba̱ta̱ u na u tsura̱i cu'un vu ucira nda, waru na̱ cine tsaa yuwan tsu la'a ucira wa̱ yi, adama tsu nla̱ yi, tsa̱ra̱ tsu suɗato yi lon. Za suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu u ta ca wu ikebe i azurufa ukpakukupa nu ukpaku (1,100).&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Reve Dalila damma Samuson, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri damma mu uba̱ta̱ u na vu tsura̱i cu'un ucira u nda. Na̱ vuma ciga wu nla̱ wu, tsa̱ra̱ u suɗato wu, cine waa yuwan na̱ a̱vu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Reve Samuson usu yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ a̱ nla̱ mu na a'yin a sa'avu e cindere a na koto a̱ 'yetsuyi shi, n to o'wo babu ucira cine akapi a ama a̱ ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Reve azagbain a aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ Dalila na a'yin a sa'avu e cindere aza a na koto e 'yetsuyi shi, reve wu nla̱ Samuson ne ele. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Agba u shi ta̱ ɗe u zuwa ali a vawan a aasula o ro a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi. Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Samuson! Aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ e reme wu!&gt;&gt; Reve Samuson kakasa a'yi'in tsa agaruma tsa na a zuwayi akina. Adama o ndolo e reve uba̱ta̱ u na ucira wa̱ yi u ri shi.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Reve u damma Samuson, &lt;&lt;Vu luma̱ mu ta̱ vu yuwaan mu epen. Gogo yuwan ankuri damma mu, cine maa gura nla̱ wu na amayun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ a̱ nla̱ mu na amunga a sa'avu a na koto a yuwayin ulinga shi, n to o'wo babu ucira cine akapi a ama a̱ ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Reve Dalila tara amunga a sa'avu, reve wu nla̱ yi ne ele. Ali'i a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ uvawun a aasula o ro cine a̱ da̱na̱i nu ufaru. Reve Dalila damma, &lt;&lt;Samuson! Aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ e reme wu!&gt;&gt; Reve Samuson kakasa amunga'a gashi a̱punda̱ a ɗa.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />A̱vu Dalila damma Samuson, &lt;&lt;Vu da̱shi ta̱ luluma̱ mu, a̱vu waru vu yuwaan mu epen. Damma mu, cine za aa gura nla̱ wu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ vu ɗava a̱kutsu e cindere a aaci a̱ va̱ a̱ a̱a̱punda̱ o uɗava, reve vu nla̱ yi na agita o uɗava ugbamu lon, n to o'wo babu ucira cine akapi a ama a̱ ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Samuson pe a̱tsuma̱ a nlavu ɗaɗa Dalila ɗavai a̱nji a̱ yi tsu umuna. Reve u yuwan yi ugbamu na aagita, reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Samuson! Aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ e reme wu!&gt;&gt; Reve u 'yon ɗaɗa woo rono a̱nji a̱ yi, reve u foɗo le diga a aagita'a na̱ a̱punda̱'a̱.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Reve Dalila damma yi, &lt;&lt;Cine vaa damma, &lt;N ciga wu ta̱,&gt; agba vu kpa̱tu'wa̱a̱ mu okolo a̱ wu shi? Vu luma̱ mu ta̱ toto uta'atsu, agba hali n gogo koto vu damma mu uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ba̱jini o ucira wa̱ wu u ri shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Reve u ka̱ra̱ a damatosun yi ana'an na̱ nfa'an na acingi. A̱vu ili'i i makan yi gashi u to una yi.<verse eid="JDG 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Ɗaɗa Samuson damma niyi ili yu usokowu ya̱ yi suru. U damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ko utanu koto u ju'wa̱n aaci a̱ va̱ shi, adama a na a̱mu za na a tawayi A̱sula̱ a ɗa diga a̱tsuma̱ a mma va̱. Na̱ za ro puna aaci a̱ va̱, n ta lamba ucira u va̱, reve moo o'wo cine akapi a ama a̱ ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Ana Dalila revei u damma yi ta̱ amayun e ili'i, reve u lyunguwa̱ azagbain a aza a Filistiya, reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;Da̱shi ta̱wa̱i u ta̱. U damma mu ta̱ amayun e ili'i suru.&gt;&gt; Ana a̱ ta̱wa̱i, reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ oɓolo ni ikebeꞌe e ekere e le. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Reve Dalila kpara Samuson, reve u zuwa yi u lantsa a agutsu a̱ yi. Reve u ɗe vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le u puna yi a̱kutsu a̱ cindere a̱ a̱nji'i. Ana u kotoi, a̱vu Dalila fara a suɗatosu yi, ɗaɗa ucira u lyawai Samuson.<verse eid="JDG 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Samuson! Aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ e reme wu!&gt;&gt; Reve u 'yon a yuwusan majiyan, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ 'yon reve m ba̱ɗa̱ aciya̱va̱ cine n tsu yuwusan.&gt;&gt; Agba u reve a na A̱sulazuva a lyawa niyi shi.<verse eid="JDG 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Reve aza a Filistiya e reme Samuson, ɗaɗa o kongoro niyi esu. Reve a tara yi a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va Gaza, reve a̱ nla̱ yi na akani a̱ rumushili. Reve a zuwa yi yira o u'wa wa ali. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Agba a̱nji a̱ yi a na a̱ shi a punai a fara ta̱ mota̱.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa Samuson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Reve azagbain a Filistiya o ɓoloto, tsa̱ra̱ a yuwaan Dagon ma̱sula̱ me le kucci gbain reve a yuwan a̱buki, a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱a̱ma̱li a̱ tsu a ca tsu ta̱ ma'yuwatan ma̱ tsu Samuson e ekere a̱ tsu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Ana ama e ene niyi, reve a cana ishipa yi ica ya̱ ma̱sula̱ me le, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Ma̱sula̱ ma̱ tsu ma a ca tsu ta̱ ma'yuwatan ma̱ tsu e ekere a̱ tsu, za na lungusa̱i iɗa i tsu reve wu una ama a̱ tsu na̱ a̱bunda̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />A mantsa ma na ama a̱ ri a uwwusa uyo'o wa̱ a̱buki'i, reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱yi na̱ Samuson tsa̱ra̱ u yuwaan tsu uro!&gt;&gt; Reve o uta̱a̱ yi diga ɗe o u'wa wa ali reve u yuwaan le uro. Reve a zuwa yi wi isawan e memere ma mpakatalai ma atsura.<verse eid="JDG 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Reve Samuson damma molobo ma na ma̱ ri uɓa̱nu na̱ a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Zuwa mu n ju'wa̱n atsura a na a̱ guza̱i a̱a̱'isa̱ a nda, adama n raɓato ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />A̱a̱'isa̱'a̱ a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ tapu na ama ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci. Suru azagbain a aza a Filistiya a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ pe. A̱bunda̱ a aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i zuva vu ukwa̱'a̱ a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ a Samuson a yuwusan uro a ta rawa ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci zuzu nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000). <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Reve Samuson yuwan ipati a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva Zagbain, yuwan ankuri cuwisan na̱ a̱mu. A̱sula̱, yuwan ankuri ne'ishe mu ucira u ta̱ nda, tsa̱ra̱ n tsupa aza a Filistiya adama e esu e re a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Reve Samuson ɓa̱na̱ atsura e re a na a̱ ri e memere aza a na a̱ ɓa̱na̱i a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱. Reve u rutsa̱ le, ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi a za ta̱ za vu ugula̱ waru a za ta̱. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa n kuwa̱ oɓolo na aza a Filistiya a nda!&gt;&gt; Reve u keɓe nu ucira, ɗaɗa a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱ u ra̱moyi a aci a azagbain a aza a Filistiya na ama a na a̱ ri pe. Ne ɗa ama a na wu unai o ukwa̱ wa̱ yi a la'ai ama a na wu unai a mantsa ma na u da̱na̱i wuma.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Reve a̱za̱ a̱ yi na̱ umatsun wa dada va̱ yi suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ tsura̱ a tara yi. Reve a̱ ka̱mba̱ na̱ a̱yi a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi e memere ma̱ Zora na̱ Eshitawo a aason a dada va̱ yi Manowa. U yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila hali a'wan ushin.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Musula̱ ma Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />A yuwan ta̱ vuma ro e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu, za na a̱ tsu ɗe Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Reve u damma mma va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Ele azurufa ukpakukupa nu ukpaku (1,100) na a tara nuwu i ɗa waru adama a za na mu uwwa nuwu a yuwusaan una̱, ikebe'e a̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱, a̱mu ɗa n tara nle.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">A̱vu mma va̱ yi damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a zuwaa wu aba'un ulobo u va̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Ana u ka̱mbuwa̱yi mma va̱ yi azurufa ukpakukupa nu ukpaku'u (1,100), reve mma va̱ yi damma, &lt;&lt;N ta casu azurufa nda e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva o una̱ wu ulobo u va̱ adama ee she'en oroci a̱ a̱ma̱li suru na̱ azurufa. Gogo n ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ wu a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />A̱vu u ka̱mbuwa̱ azurufa'a uba̱ta̱ wa mma va̱ yi, a̱vu mma va̱ yi tara azurufa ukpakure (200) a̱vu u ca maruma ma azurufa, za na she'ein oroci a̱ ma̱sula̱ reve u sura yi na̱ azurufa'a. A̱vu a zuwa yi o u'wa wa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Reve gba Mika tsura̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, a̱vu u yuwan epo oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱li o ro, a̱vu u zuwa ulobo u ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o olobo a̱ yi wo o'wo yi ganu. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: A̱. Ug 18:1; 19:1; 21:25</char></note>A rana ndolo aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ mogono shi, za suru tsu yuwan ta̱ cine u cigai.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />A yuwan ta̱ ulobo u ro za vu ugundo wa̱ Levi diga Batalami a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Ulobo'o u lyawa ta̱ lyuci va Batalami e izami yu uba̱ta̱ u na wa̱a̱ da̱nu. Reve a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a mmalu, u rawa o u'wa wa Mika a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu.<verse eid="JDG 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />A̱vu Mika ece yi, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Reve u usu yi, &lt;&lt;A̱mu za va Levi ɗa diga Batalami a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda, waru n te e izami yu uba̱ta̱ u na ma̱a̱ da̱nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />A̱vu Mika damma yi, &lt;&lt;Isawan pa oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, voo o'wo mu dada na̱ ganu, n ta ca wu azurufa kupa a̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan, ni itana yu otosu ni ilyalya i malya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />A̱vu a̱yi za va Levi'i u usu u da̱nu oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. A̱vu wo o'wo tso ulobo wa̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />A̱vu Mika zuwa yi wo o'wo ganu va̱ yi, reve waru u da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Ɗaɗa Mika tsu damma, &lt;&lt;Gogo tsunda n reve ta̱ A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa ili biti i wala mu mejege, adama a na za va Levi nda o'woi ganu va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika oɓolo nu ugundo wa Dan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">18:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">A̱. Ug 17:6; 19:1; 21:25</char>
    </note>A̱tsuma̱ a rana ndeɗe a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ mogono a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila shi. A̱tsuma̱ a rana'a ugundo wa Dan u zamishi ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wu nden adama a aciyele, adama a na hali a mantsa'a koto a̱ tsura̱ uba̱ta̱ wa agadu a̱tsuma̱ o gundo va aza a Isra'ila shi. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Reve ama a Dan a̱ lyungu ama o ton diga o ugundo u le diga a̱tyo e iɗa i le aza a na a gurai uvon diga Zora waru diga Eshitawo a tawa utyo wi iɗa'a, a̱vu a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ yi. A̱vu a damma le, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱i i ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa'a.&gt;&gt; Ana ali o uvo'on a rawai e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu, a̱vu a uwa o u'wa wa Mika a asa pe. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Ana a rawai zuzu nu u'wa wa Mika, a gura ta̱ reve uɗyo wu ulobo wu ugundo wa̱ Levi'i. A̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ yi, a̱vu e ece yi, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa ta̱wa̱to nuwu pa? Nye vaa yuwusan pa uba̱ta̱ u nda? Ulinga wu nye i ɗa vaa yuwusan pa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Reve u damma le ili i na Mika yuwaan niyi, u damma, &lt;&lt;U tara mu ta̱ ulinga waru a̱mu ganu va̱ yi ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />A̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu yuwan ankuri ve ece A̱sula̱, adama tsu tsura̱ urevu ko mmalu n na tsu cigai tsu 'ya̱wa̱ tsu ta lyuwa aci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Reve ganu'u u damma le, &lt;&lt;Walai no okolo nden, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />A̱vu ama o to'on e reme ure, a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ Layish, uba̱ta̱ u na a cinai ama a̱ ri nden gbaga, cine vu revei aza a Sidon a yuwusan wuma u le asuvu nden a̱ nden gbaga. Agba ko ili i ta̱ a lamba a̱tsuma̱ a̱ nden mu uvaɗi n le shi, a̱ ta̱ nu utsuru. Waru a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ alanga na aza a Sidon waru a̱ ri a muwwulai no ozo o ro shi.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Ana a̱ ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ le ɗe Zora na̱ Eshitawo, ɗaɗa a̱za̱ le a̱ tsu damma le, &lt;&lt;Cine tsa ɗa i cinai ili'i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Reve a damma, &lt;&lt;'Yoyin tsu riya̱a̱ nle nu uvon! Tse ene ta̱ ɗe iɗa'a, waru na a amayun u ta̱ ulobonu lon. A̱ɗu yaa yuwan ili i ro shi? She i lungusa̱ mantsa na ya̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ i uwa i usa iɗa'a wo o'wo za ɗu wan. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />A mantsa ma na i rawai ɗe i ta cina ama a yuwusan nden gbaga. Iɗa i ta̱ mgbain, waru A̱sula̱ a ca ta̱ ɗe iɗa'a e ekere a̱ ɗu, uba̱ta̱ u ɗa u na u lambai ili shi a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />A̱vu ama ukpakuta̱li (600) diga o ugundo wa Dan o foɓo ni itana yu uvon, a lyawa Zora na̱ Eshitawo. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a gawan a̱ va̱la̱ a̱livu a Kiriyat Jeyarim a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda. Adama o ndolo a̱ tsu ɗe uba̱ta̱'a̱ Mahane Dan, a na uva̱la̱ta̱ wa Dan, hali a̱ tyo ana'an. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Diga lo reve a̱ ka̱ra̱la̱i ni iɗa ya aagaɗi ya Ifiramu, a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ o u'wa wa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Reve ama o ton a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i a tawa utyo wi iɗa ya Layish a damma a̱za̱ e le, &lt;&lt;Ko i reve ta̱ a na a̱tsuma̱ a 'wa nda a̱ ta̱ pe na̱ epo nu u'wa wa̱ a̱ma̱li na̱ she'en oroci a̱ ma̱sula̱ n na a surai na̱ azurufa? Gogo she i reve ili i na yaa yuwan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />A̱vu a ɓatsa a uwa a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wu ulobo za va̱ Levi za na ri uba̱ta̱ wa Mika'a reve a̱ ca̱sa̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Ama ukpakuta̱li (600) diga o ugundo wa Dan, ufoɓu ni itana yu uvon i le, a̱vu e isawan o u'uwata wu una̱ntsu. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />A̱vu ama o ton a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i matawa mo utyo wi iɗa'a a uwa pe, a̱vu a tara oroci a na e she'ei'in za na a surai na̱ azurufa na̱ a̱ma̱li na̱ epo. A̱yi gba ganu a̱vu wi isawan o u'uwata wu una̱ntsu oɓolo na ali o uvon ukpakuta̱li (600) ufoɓu ni itana yu uvon.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Ana ama a nda a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i o u'wa wa Mika a tarai oroci a na e she'ein i na a surai na̱ azurufa na̱ a̱ma̱li na̱ epo, a̱vu ganu damma le, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa yaa yuwusan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />A̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ɓa̱ru una̱ wa̱ wu! She vu yuwan adanshi wan. Vu ta̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu a̱vu vo o'wo dada e ekere a̱ tsu na̱ ganu tsu. Waa la'aa wu vu yuwaan ugundo nu umatsun wa aza a Isra'ila ulinga u tsuganu, a na vo o'wo ganu vu u'wa u ta̱ shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />A̱vu ganu'u u yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱. Reve u tara epo na̱ a̱ma̱li no oroci a na e she'ein u ka̱ra̱ oɓolo na ama'a. <verse eid="JDG 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Reve a vadala e reme mmalu n le oɓolo na̱ muwun n le ni iliyamunga i le oɓolo nu utsuru u le elime.<verse eid="JDG 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Ana ama diga o ugundo wa Dan a̱ ka̱ra̱i alanga a lyawai u'wa wa Mika, a̱vu Mika ɓoloto aza a na a̱ ri nden zuzu nu u'wa wa̱ yi suru, reve a saɓa le. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Reve a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo u le e ɗe aza a Dan, a̱vu gba aza a Dan a vadala a̱vu e ece Mika, &lt;&lt;Nye ya̱ ɓa̱la̱ wu, a na vu ɓolotoi ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a nda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;I tara ta̱ musula̱ n na n yuwain, oɓolo na̱ ganu va̱, a̱vu i ka̱ra̱ ne ele. Ili i ne i ɗa waru m buwai ne ele? Cine tsa ɗa ye ece, &lt;Nye ya̱ ɓa̱la̱ wu?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Reve aza a Dan a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;She tsu da̱shi uwwa uɗyo wa̱ wu wan, na̱ ne ɗa shi aza a na a̱ ri na asuvu usuɗuwu a̱ ta̱ riya̱a̱ wu nu uvon, reve, a̱vu vu lamba wuma wa̱ wu na̱ wuma wa̱ a̱za̱ o u'wa wa̱ wu fo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Ɗaɗa aza a Dan a saɓai ure u le. Ana Mika enei a la'a yi ta̱ ucira lon, a̱vu u vadala u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Amma a aza a Dan a tara ta̱ i ili i na Mika yuwain, oɓolo na̱ ganu va̱ yi, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Layish uba̱ta̱ wa ama a na aa yuwusan wuma u le asuvu nden a̱ nden gbaga, a̱vu a̱ riya̱a̱ le nu uvon na̱ matsun me pe'eni a̱vu waru a̱ kula̱to lyuci'i. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Waru babu vuma na aa gura wawa le adama a na a̱ ta̱ alanga na̱ Sidon, waru a̱ ri a muwwulai no ozo o ro shi. Lyuci'i u da̱na̱ ta̱ o uka̱ri wa Bet Reho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:28">Ɗaɗa a suwisai lyuci'i a̱vu a̱ da̱nu pe. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Ɗaɗa a cayi lyuci'i aala Dan o una̱ wa akaya e le Dan, za na a matsayin Isra'ila, ko na wo o'woi a̱ shi ta̱ a̱ tsu ɗe lyuci'i Layish nu ufaru. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />A̱vu aza a Dan a̱ shuwa̱a̱ aciyele oroci o ushe'e'en, a̱vu Jonata ulobo wa Gashum, ulobo wa Musa, no olobo a̱ yi a̱ da̱na̱ nan ganu e ekere o ugundo wa a aza a Dan hali mantsa ma na a̱ pura̱i nle a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u tsugbashi. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />A̱vu a̱ shuwa̱ oroci e she'en na Mika yuwain, hali a mantsa ma na suru u'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ u da̱na̱i ɗe Shilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Levi ro na̱ ka vu nge'en</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: A̱.Ug 17:6; 18:1; 21:25</char>
    </note>A rana ndeɗe aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ mogono shi. A yuwan ta̱ Levi ro za na da̱na̱i na̱ nden a̱ mpulu e iɗa ya aagaɗi ya Ifiramu, za na tarai ka vu nge'en adama a aciya̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a Batalami va Yahuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Agba ka'a u da̱na̱ na̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a̱ yi shi. U lyawa ta̱ vali'i a̱vu u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a Batalami va Yahuda. Reve u yuwan ɗe woto na̱shi. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />A̱vu vali'i u 'ya̱wa̱ u ca yi adanshi tsa̱ra̱ u ka̱mba̱. U 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ oɓolo na aagbashi a̱ yi na̱ nloli n re. Reve u tara vali'i a̱ tyo o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi, ana dada va̱ yi ene niyi, u raba yi ta̱ na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />A̱vu a̱sha̱wa̱le, dada vu usheli'i, u zuwa yi u da̱nu oɓolo ne ele hali u yuwan pe rana ta'atsu. Reve a lyuwa o sowo a̱vu wa asusa pe.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />O urana wa̱ na̱shi, a̱vu a̱ 'yon na̱ wasasa a̱vu o foɓo adama a̱ ka̱ra̱, a̱vu dada vu usheli'i u damma toto va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Vu lyuwa ili i ro adama vu tsura̱ ucira, a̱vu i ka̱ra̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />A̱vu a̱ da̱nu ele ra a lyuwa o sowo oɓolo. A̱vu dada vu usheli'i u damma vali'i, &lt;&lt;Vu yuwan ankuri vu da̱shi asa pa tsa̱ra̱ vu uwwaa aciya̱wu uyo'o.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Ana toto'o u 'yoyin tsa̱ra̱ u ka̱ra̱, a̱vu a̱sha̱wa̱le a kpara yi wi isawan, a̱vu wa asisa ayin o ndolo. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />O urana wa tawun na̱ wasasa, ana u 'yoyin tsa̱ra̱ u ka̱ra̱, a̱vu dada vu usheli'i u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu lyuwa ilyalya adama vu tsura̱ ucira hali urana u gaɗuwa.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa a lyuwai ilyalya ra.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Ana vali'i u 'yoyin adama u ka̱ra̱ a̱yi oɓolo na̱ ka vu nge'en va̱ yi na aagbashi a̱ yi, a̱vu dada vu usheli, a̱sha̱wa̱le, u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱ gogo urana u koto ta̱. Va asisa pa, gogo ɗa usana waa tawa. Vi isawan vu uwwaa aciya̱wu uyo'o. Nfa'an nu usana usana a̱vu i ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o u'wa u ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Amma a̱yi gba vali'i a mantsa ma nda u ciga wa asisa shi. A̱vu u 'yon a̱vu u yuwan mmalu ma̱ yi. A̱vu u rawa Jebusiya za na a̱yi ɗa Urishelima, oɓolo na̱ nloli n re ma̱ yi aza a na a̱ ri na̱ rutsu vu nden na̱ ka vu nge'en va̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Ana a rawai zuzu na̱ Jebusiya waru urana u cigai mokotoo, a̱vu aagbashi'i a damma zavu'wa va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri, lyawa tsu ɓatsai a̱ lyuci va aza a Jebusiya tsa asai pe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Ɗaɗa zagbain va̱ yi damma niyi, &lt;&lt;O'o, tsaa ɓatsa a̱ lyuci vo omocin shi, aza a na ama e le aza a Isra'ila a ɗa shi. Tsu ta̱ ka̱ra̱la̱i a̱ tyo Gibiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />A̱vu u damma aagbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Lyawai tsu rawai zuzu na̱ ba̱ta̱ ndeɗe tsa̱ra̱ tsaa asai Gibiya ko Rama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Ɗaɗa a lyuwai elime na̱ mmalu. Reve urana u koto le zuzu na̱ Gibiya upasu wi iɗa wa Banyami. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Lo ɗa a ɓatsai adama aa asa. A̱vu za va Levi'i u 'ya̱wa̱ u da̱nu a aagalaci a̱ lyuci'i, adama a na a̱ tsura̱ vuma na tara nle a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ yi aa asa shi.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Nu ulivu u ndolo aabara o ro a̱ shi ta̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ diga o uɗuma̱. A̱yi za vi iɗa ya aagaɗi a Ifiramu ɗa, amma u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ nden Gibiya. Ama o uba̱ta̱'a̱ a̱za̱ o ugundo wa Banyami a ɗa. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Ana u 'ya̱sa̱in aaci reve we ene za vu mmalu'u a agalaci a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i, reve aabara'a we ece, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa vee tyo? Te ɗa waru vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;Tsu uta̱ ta̱ diga Batalami va Yahuda, tsu ta̱ tyo mpulu n ro vi iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu uba̱ta̱ u na n ri na̱ nde. N 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ Batalami va Yahuda, gogo gba n ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva. Ko vuma lyawa n cu'wan o u'wa wa̱ yi shi. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Tsu ta̱ na̱ tsu'yuwa̱ ni ilyalya yi nloli n tsu, tsu ta̱ waru no opopofu na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi, adama a̱ va̱ aagbashi a̱ wu na aagbashi o usheli a̱ wu, nu ulobo u na u ri oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu. Ko ili i ta̱ tsu lamba shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />A̱vu aabara'a u damma le, &lt;&lt;Asuvu a̱ wu a̱ da̱nu, n ta ca wu ili i na vaa ciga suru. Amma she vaa asa a agalaci a̱ lyuci wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Ɗaɗa u tara nle a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ yi, a̱vu u ca nloli n le ilyalya. Ana o kotoi masa'a ma ana me ele, reve a lyuwa o sowo oɓolo.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Ele pe a uwwusaa aciyele uyo'o, a̱vu ama a vama o ro a̱tsuma̱ lyuci'i a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ u'wa'a. A̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a lapusa una̱ntsu, a̱vu waru a damma aabara'a za vu u'wa'a, &lt;&lt;Uta̱a̱ na̱ vuma na uwai o u'wa wa̱ wu, tsa̱ra̱ tsu yuwan tsipere na̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />A̱vu za vu u'wa'a wu uta̱ a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Aa yuwan tsundolo shi, n'utsa̱ n va̱. She i yuwan iwuya tsunda wan. Adama a na vuma nda mocin va̱ ɗa, she i yuwan ili i wono tsunda wan. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Ka̱lyuwa̱i, apa usheli u va̱ za na koto revei vali shi, oɓolo na̱ ka vu nge'en va̱ yi. N ta̱ uta̱wa̱ ɗu ele a alanga gogo, i ta gura suɗato le, a̱vu waru i yuwan ili i na i cigai ne ele. Amma e ekere a vuma nda, she i yuwan cu'un vi ili i wono i nda wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Agba ama'a a zuwaa yi atsuvu shi. A̱vu vuma va̱ Levi'i u reme ka vu nge'en va̱ yi wu uta̱wa̱ le a alanga, a̱vu o von na̱ a̱yi babu ucigu wa̱ yi, reve waru a yuwan na̱ a̱yi ili i na a cigai a̱tsuma̱ a ayin o ndolo, usana a matawaa a̱vu a lyawa yi u ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Na̱ wasasa a̱vu ka'a u ta̱wa̱ u riya̱ e iɗa o una̱ntsu wu u'wa wa aabara'a uba̱ta̱ u na zagbain va̱ yi cu'wain, hali uba̱ta̱ u palu'wa.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Ana zagbain va̱ yi 'yoyin nu usana, a̱vu u kpa̱tu'wa̱ una̱ntsu wu u'wa'a a̱vu wu uta̱ tsa̱ra̱ u lyuwa elime na̱ mmalu ma̱ yi, a̱vu gba u cinishi ka'a nven, uriyu o una̱ntsu wu u'wa'a, ne ekere a̱ yi uzuwu o una̱ntsu. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />A̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;'Yon tsu wala!&gt;&gt; Agba u usu shi. A̱vu vali'i u zuwa yi o mololi ma̱ yi, a̱vu e reme mmalu a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa.<verse eid="JDG 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Ana u rawai o u'wa, a̱vu u tara matsun a̱vu reme ka'a, a̱vu wu paɗa yi apaɗi apaɗi, hali ba̱ta̱ kupa ne ejere, a̱vu u lyunguwa̱ ugundo wa aza a a Isra'ila suru aapaɗi a̱ ta̱. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Za na ene niyi suru u damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Koto a yuwan ko ene cu'un nda shi, diga urana u na aza a Isra'ila a lyawai iɗa i tsugbashi a Masar. I yuwan majiyan ma̱ yi! Yuwain a̱sa̱la̱ e ili i na i farai! A̱vu i damma tsu ili i na tsaa yuwan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila a yuwan ta̱ uvon na aza a Banyami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila suru diga upasu wu ugana u lyuci wa Dan a̱ tyo upasu wu uyagi u lyuci wa Biyasheba na̱ diga e iɗa ya Giliyadu o uta̱ a alanga tse elentsu a̱ ta̱ a̱vu o ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a Mizfa. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />A̱vu azagbain a ama o gundo va a aza a Isra'ila suru o roco aciyele uba̱ta̱ wo oɓolo a ama a̱ A̱sula̱. A̱bunda̱ a̱ a̱soja a na a̱ da̱na̱i a ana ni itana yu uvon a ta rawa ama ukpakukupa ukpakuna̱shi (400,000). <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />A̱za̱ o ugundo wa Banyami a uwwa ta̱ a na aza a Isra'ila a gawan ta̱ a̱ tyo Mizfa. Reve aza a Isra'ila a damma, &lt;&lt;Damma ntsu cine ili i wuya i nda i farai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Ɗaɗa Levi, vali vu ka na o unai'i, u dammai, &lt;&lt;A̱mu na̱ ka vu nge'en va̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ Gibiya va Banyami tsa̱ra̱ tsaa asa. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Na ayin a̱vu azagbain a Gibiya o toni mu a̱vu a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ u'wa'a, azama o una mu. A̱vu o von na̱ ka vu nge'en va̱ babu ucigu wa̱ yi, reve u kuwa̱. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />A̱vu n tara ka'a, reve mu paɗa yi apaɗi apaɗi, a̱vu n lyungu mupaɗi ma̱ yi za ta̱ ta̱ a̱ tyo upasu wa agadu wa aza a Isra'ila suru, adama a na ama a nda a yuwan ta̱ ili i wuya ni ili i wono a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Gogo, lyawa aza a Isra'ila suru a ca a̱sa̱la̱ ni ili i na wu ntsayi adama a nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Reve ama'a suru a̱ 'yon nu uta̱ a damma, &lt;&lt;Babu vuma na a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o oogodo a̱ yi, ko vuma ta̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi shi. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Gogo, apa ili i na tsaa yuwain na ama a Gibiya: Tsu ta zuwai agita a̱vu tsu 'ya̱wa̱a̱ nle nu uvon cine mazuwa ma agita ma dammai. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Tsu ta tara ama kupa kupa a̱tsuma̱ o ukpaku (100) a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa Isra'ila suru, ukpaku waru a̱tsuma̱ o ukpakukupa (1,000), ukpakukupa waru a̱tsuma̱ o ukpakukupa kupa (10,000), adama a̱ ta̱wa̱ ni ili i na suru a̱soja a na a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon a cigai. A̱vu, na a rawa Gibiya a̱tsuma̱ a Banyami, aza a Gibiya a̱ tsura̱ ili i na yi ntsaa nle adama e ili i wono i na a yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Reve ali a Isra'ila suru o ɓoloto uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ o ɓolo aci tsa̱ra̱ a yuwan uvon na̱ lyuci'i.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Reve gundo va Isra'ila a̱ lyungu ama a̱ ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wu ugundo wa Banyami suru, adansa, &lt;&lt;Cu'un vi ili i wuya i ne i ɗa i yuwain tsunda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Gogo uta̱yi ama a vama a Gibiya a nda a alanga tsa̱ra̱ tsu una le, tsa̱ra̱ tsu uta̱a̱ ni iwuya i nda a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt; Amma ama a Banyami a zuwaa a̱za̱ e le a Isra'ila atsuvu shi. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />A̱vu ama a Banyami o uta̱ e ilyuci ya Gibiya nu uta̱, adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Aza a Banyami o ɓoloto ta̱ aza a na a gurai uvon na̱ matsun ma̱ pe'eni e ilyuci i le, ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakuta̱li (26,000). Babu nu ukpakucindere (700) a na a ɗangulai aza a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a Gibiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱soja a nda suru a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ pe na ama ukpakucindere (700) aza a na a ɗangwai a na a la'a gurai uvon nu ugula̱, a̱tsuma̱ e le suru vuma ta gura vari aatali na̱ a̱bitsutsu a̱ a̱nji agba waa nusan shi.<verse eid="JDG 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Agba ama a Isra'ila, babu na ama a Banyami a̱vu o ɓoloto a̱soja ukpakukupa ukpakuna̱shi (400,000) aza a na a̱ ri na̱ mutsun mu pe'eni, ama a nda suru aza a na a gurai uvon u ɗa.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />A̱vu ama a Isra'ila a gawan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Betel reve a yuwan yeci uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu zane ɗa aa fara gawan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ u yuwan uvon na ama a Banyami?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Yahuza ɗa aa fara 'ya̱wa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Ana usana u tawai reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'yon a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu na̱ Gibiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Banyami. Reve aza a Isra'ila e gere adama o uvo'on hali a̱ tyo Gibiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />A̱vu ama a Banyami o uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Gibiya reve o kototo aza a Isra'ila ama ukpakukupa ushin ne ejere (22,000) o urana u ndolo. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a calai adanshi reve waru e gerishe tsa̱ra̱ a yuwisan uvo'on cine a yuwain urana wu ufaru. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a gawan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu a yuwan mesun hali ulivu. A̱vu a zami urevu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu 'ya̱wisa̱ tsu yuwan uvon na ama a Banyami a̱za̱ a̱ tsu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu le, &lt;&lt;Gawain a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ i yuwan ne ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a rawa zuzu na ama a Banyami o urana we ire. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />A mantsa ma nda, ana aza a Banyami o uta̱i diga Gibiya adama a yuwan uvon ne ele, reve o una ama Isra'ila ukpakukupa kupa na̱ ukpakukupa kunla̱ (18,000), suru nle aza a na a gurai mutsun pe'eni ɗa.<verse eid="JDG 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />A̱vu ama a Isra'ila suru, o uta̱ a̱vu a gawan a̱ tyo Betel reve a̱ da̱nu a̱ shon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve a yuwan akuli o urana u ndolo hali ulivu, reve a ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a zami urevu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. A rana ndolo Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ lo. <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Finiha ulobo wa Eliyaza, ulobo wa Haruna, u yuwusan ta̱ ulinga u tsuganu a mantsa'a. A̱vu aza a Isra'ila e ece A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;Tsu da̱shi uta̱ a gawan tsu yuwan uvon na̱ Banyami a̱za̱ a̱ tsu, ko tsu lyawa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Gawain a̱ 'ya̱wa̱, adama a na nfa'an n ta ca ɗu ele e ekere a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Ɗaɗa aza a Isra'ila o foɓoi ama a vawan o ogozo a Gibiya a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:1-29">Jos 8:1-29</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Reve a gawan tsa̱ra̱ a yuwan uvon na aza a Banyami o urana wa ta'atsu, reve e gere adama a yuwan uvon na̱ Gibiya, cine a yuwain nu ufaru. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Reve aza a Banyami o uta̱ adama a ga'an ne ele. Reve o rono le alanga na̱ lyuci. A̱vu a uwa o unusa aza a Isra'ila tsu ufaru, hali ama mata'atsu a̱ kuwa̱ a agalaci no o ure u na u ri a̱ tyo Betel na̱ za na ri a̱ tyo Gibiya waru.<verse eid="JDG 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Aza a Banyami a dansa, &lt;&lt;Tsu to o unusa le tsu ufaru.&gt;&gt; Aza a Isra'ila gba a dansa, &lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu sumai adama tsu rono nle alanga na̱ lyuci a̱ tyo e re.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila suru a̱ 'yon diga ba̱ta̱ na a̱ ri, a̱vu e gerishe a Ba'al Tama. A̱vu ama e le a na a̱ ri uvawun a̱livu a Gibiya o utushi. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a na a gurai uvon ama ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) a̱ riya̱a̱ Gibiya nu uvon. Uvon gba u suɗuwa ta̱, agba aza a Banyami e reve a na meleshe ma̱ ri zuzu ne ele shi. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />A̱sulazuva gba a lyuwa ta̱ Banyami nu uvon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Isra'ila. O urana u ndolo reve gba aza a Isra'ila o una ama a Banyami ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa uton nu ukpaku (25,100). Suru nle gba aza a na a gurai uvon na̱ matsun ma pe'eni n ɗa. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />A̱vu ama a Banyami e reve na a lyuwa nle nu uvon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Aza a Isra'ila a̱ shi ta̱ o ronusoo ama a Banyami na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ adama a na a zuwaa ta̱ ama a na zuwai a vawan zuzu na̱ Gibiya ucira. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Reve ama a na a̱ shi a vawain o utushi a̱ riya̱a̱ Gibiya, a̱vu a uwa upasu biti a̱vu o una ama a na a̱ ri pe a̱ lyuci'i suru na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Aza a Isra'ila a lyawulayi ta̱ na aza a na a̱ shi uvawun a na a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n mikyon lon a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Reve ama a Isra'ila a vadala nu uvon ana e enei mikyo'on. Aza a Banyami a̱ shi ta̱ ɗe e teme mona ma aza a Isra'ila hali a̱ shi ɗe o una ama a na a rawai mata'atsu. Reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta lyuwusa le nu uvon tsu ufaru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Agba a na iroci i mikyon i temei a̱ 'yosun a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i, a̱vu aza a Banyami a vadala, reve e ene mikyon n lyuci'i suru a gawusan zuva. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Reve ama a Isra'ila a vadala a̱ ka̱mba̱ ya̱'a̱ le, a̱vu ama a Banyami a uwwa wovon lon, adama a na e reve ta̱ meleshe ma̱ riya̱a̱ le ta̱. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Ɗaɗa a sumayi aza a Isra'ila a̱ tyo a̱tsumona, agba a gura la'a uvo'on shi. Reve ama a na o uta̱i e ilyuci i ro e reme le o una. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Reve a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ aza a Banyami, a saɓa le babu uro diga Menuha hali a rawa Gibiya na asana. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />O una ta̱ aza a Banyami ukpakukupa kupa na̱ ukpakukupa kunla̱ (18,000), suru nle aza a na a gurai uvon ɗa. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Ana a vadalai reve a suma a uwa a̱tsumona a̱ tyo a aatali a Rimo. Reve aza a Isra'ila o una ta̱ ama ukpakukupa uton (5,000) e re. A lyuwa ta̱ elime a saɓusa aza a Banyami hali a rawa Gidom, reve a̱ da̱shi una ama ukpakukupa ure (2,000) waru.<verse eid="JDG 20:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />O urana u ndolo ama a Banyami aza a na gurai uvon na̱ matsun me pe'eni ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa uton (25,000) u ɗa kuwa̱i, suru nle aza a na gurai uvon. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Amma ali ukpakuta̱li (600) a vadala ta̱ a suma a uwa a̱tsumona a̱ tyo a aatali a Rimo, uba̱ta̱ u na e isawain hali woto na̱shi. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />A̱vu ama a Isra'ila a vadala a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Banyami, a̱vu o una le e ilyuci'i suru na̱ matsun ma pe'eni, oɓolo ni iliyamunga ni ili i na suru a cinai. Ilyuci i na a cinai suru a daɓa le ta̱ akina.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">A̱ma̱ci adama a ama a Banyami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Aza a Isra'ila a tara ta̱ akucunu ɗe Mizfa: &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu babu vuma ta̱ na aa ca usheli wa̱ yi wo olo ama a Banyami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Reve ama'a a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Betel, uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ da̱nuyi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sula̱ hali ulivu, a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ɗyo le e mesun babu uyo'o. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, nye i zuwai ili i nda i cina ntsu, adama n nye tsaa lamba ugundo u ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila ana'an?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Ana usana u tawai na̱ wasasa, a̱vu ama o foɓo masa'a reve a ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ za muwwulai.<verse eid="JDG 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a yuwan yeci, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa aza a Isra'ila suru zane ɗa kuɗa̱i o ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva?&gt;&gt; Adama a na a yuwan ta̱ ɗe akucunu a Mizfa vuma na suru kuɗa̱i o ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ to una yi na amayun.<verse eid="JDG 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila e ene iliyali ya̱ a̱za̱ e le aza a Banyami. Reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Ana'an o koɗo ta̱ ugundo u ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Cine tsa ɗa tsaa yuwain a̱vu tsu zamiya aza a na a buwai a̱ma̱ci, adama a na tsu tara ta̱ ɗe akucunu na̱ A̱sulazuva a na tsa ca le esheli a̱ tsu lolo shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Reve e ece, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ o gundo va aza a Isra'ila zane ɗa kuɗa̱i a gawan a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva ɗe Mizfa?&gt;&gt; Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ e reve a na babu vuma na ta̱wa̱i diga a̱ lyuci va Jabe Giliyadu uba̱ta̱ e iɓolo. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Adama a na ana e kecei ama'a, a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ e reve na babu vuma na ta̱wa̱i ɗe a̱tsuma̱ a ama a Jabe Giliyadu.<verse eid="JDG 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Reve oɓolo'o a̱ lyungu aza a na a gurai uvon ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa ure (12,000) nu udammu, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱i Jabe Giliyadu yu una ama a na a̱ ri pe na̱ nden suru oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Apa ili i na yaa yuwan, i kototo ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci a na e revei ɗe ali suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Reve a̱ tsura̱ a̱tsuma̱ a ama a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ Jabe Giliyadu esheli a wawa'a ukpakuna̱shi (400) a na koto e revei ali shi, reve a tara le a̱ tyo o uva̱la̱ta̱ a Shilo, za na ri e iɗa ya Ka'ana.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Reve oɓolo a ama a aza a Isra'ila suru a̱ lyungu ni ikaka ya asuvu a̱ nden a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Banyami aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ nden a aatali a Rimo. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />A̱vu aza a Banyami a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa le a mantsa mo ndolo. Reve aza a Isra'ila a ca le a̱ma̱ci a na a lyawai wuma a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ma̱ci a Jabe Giliyadu, agba a rawa le suru shi.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Reve ama'a ene iliyali ya Banyami, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ shi ta̱ azama u tasa le a̱tsuma̱ o gundo va aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Reve mbara mi iɓolo'o a damma, &lt;&lt;Cine tsa ɗa tsaa yuwain na ali o ugundo wa Banyami a na a̱ tsura̱i a̱ma̱ci shi adama a na o kototoi a̱ma̱ci e le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Reve a damma, &lt;&lt;A ciga a 'yuwan a̱ tsura̱ agadu adama aza a na a la'ai o ugundo wa Banyami, tsa̱ra̱ ugundo'o u koto a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila wan. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Agba tsaa gura ca nle esheli a̱ tsu o o'wo a̱ma̱ci e le shi.&gt;&gt; Adama a na aza a Isra'ila'a yuwan ta̱ ɗe akucunu: &lt;&lt;Za na suru cayi za va Banyami ka, una̱ u ta̱ reme yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Gogo tsunda a ta yuwusan a̱buki a̱ A̱sulazuva za na a tsu yuwusan aa'wan suru ɗe Shilo, a̱ tyo o ugana wa̱ Betel, na asana o ure gawaan ve Betel a̱ tyo Shekem, waru nu uyagi wa̱ Lebona.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Reve a damma ama a Banyami,&lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱i i vawan a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />a̱vu i ka̱lyuwa̱. Ne esheli a̱ Shilo o uta̱ tsa̱ra̱ a uwa uje'en u le, a̱vu yu uta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi vuma suru u rono za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le a̱ ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya Banyami wo o'wo ka va̱ yi. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Na̱ nan dada e le ko azakpakpara e le a̱ showen tsu, tsu ta damma le, &lt;Yuwaan ntsu isa'ani o una̱ u na yaa kamba le, adama a na tsu tsura̱a̱ le a̱ma̱ci a mantsa mo uvon shi. Agba a̱ɗu waru i ri na̱ unusu shi, adama a na i ca le esheli a̱ ɗu shi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Reve ama a Banyami a yuwan ne. Esheli'i a̱tsuma̱ o uje'en, vali suru reme ta̱ za ta̱ a̱vu u rono yi wo o'wo ka va̱ yi. Reve a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa agadu e le, reve a suwisa ilyuci'i a̱vu a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ e le.<verse eid="JDG 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />A mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila a lyawai uba̱ta̱'a̱, reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o gundo le na̱ matsun le, vuma suru uba̱ta̱ wa agadu a̱ yi.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21:25 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 17.6; 18:1; 19:1</char>
    </note>A rana ndolo aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ mogono shi, za suru tsu yuwan ta̱ cine u cigai.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>